<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Kimbu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Empola Nsoga kete venaa yaleyandekhwa no Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Empola Nsoga venaa aleyandekhwaa no</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Olongoli</para>
  <para style="ip">Mpola Nsoga kete venaa aleyendekhwaa no Yohana nanecho a kemwi mo vetabu venee venaa vepwale kho Ilekhaano laseji venaa vekhopalela wome wa Yesu Kilisto. Kela kemwi cha vetabu evyoo kekhwetwaa “Injili,” Emaana yakwe, “Mpola Nsoga.” Vetabu eve alevyandekhwa no Mateo, Maluko, Luka no Yohana panaa Yesu aleafwaa. Mpola Nsoga kete venaa aleyandekhwa no Yohana, aleyandekhwa no Yohana mwakha gwa makomi kenda panaa Yesu Kilisto alealelwaa. Ninga venaa ketabu kekhakekhopaala kete Yohana amwenee yunaa aleandekha, ila venaa aleandekha maandekho gakwe gakhwipyana ne ganaa gapwale mo talatasi ja Yohana wa mwandyo, Yohana wa owele no Yohana wa otato. Vandeki vamoonga va pamyakha vakhopalelaa kete Yohana angile khwikhala ihala la Efeso pi ituungo eloo, gechoo amo ketabu eke alechandekhwa pi ihala la Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana alekhosiima vantu vakhowole khogoomba kete Yesu amwenee Kilisto, Mwana wa Matuunda yunaa mopanga 20:31. Khwa khogoomba gechoo, nakhokhowola khopelwaa wome khokelela lina lakwe. Ketabu eke alechandekhwaa kho vamanyi va Kiyahudi ne vanaa angile nkha Vayahudi. Mpola Nsoga ya kete venaa aleyandekhwaa no Yohana ele shaa ne Mpola Nsoga ejoo jetato jiinge. Yohana akunelelya ematuntumu egoo ganaa Yesu aleaganojaa, ninga gechoo aleakhandekha minki khopalela picha ja mefwano jenaa alekhopumya Yesu. Mpola jiinge alejikhandekhwa kete mpola ya khobatijwa khwa Yesu, Yesu panaa aleagemwaa pitenengwa, gensi ega alegakhaandekhwa mo Mpola Nsoga eye.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ganaa gapwale</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana khwandyaa Mpola Nsoga kho osho 1:1-18</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana khopalela matuntumu ga Yesu kho osho 1:19-12:50</para>
  <para style="io">Khanke Yohana khopalela wome wa Yesu wonaa alewakenkelelyaa ncha yakwe no khofufokha kho osho 13:1-20:31</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana khomalelyaa khwa khwandekha Mpola Nsoga yakwe kho osho 21 taali aleapalela panaa Yesu aleavapumela vantu panaa aleafufokha, khanke Yohana khopalelaa nseembo yakwe ya khwandekha ketabu eke.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Mpola aleanojekha muntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Pa mwandyo panaa liwelelo alelekhale khowombwaa, Mpola aleapwale. Mpola oyoo angile alepalomwi no Matuunda, no Mpola oyoo angile Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Khopuma mwandyo Mpola angile alepalomwi no Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Matuunda aleawombaa vento vyensi khokelela Mpola, khotopo ninga kento kemwii kenaa alechawombwaa patopo khokelela omwene. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Mokhate mwakwe angile khole opanga, no opanga owoo awenee angile welo wa vantu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Welo ogoo gokhomolekha kho kiiti, ne kiiti alelekhakhowola khowokhonya welo.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Aleapwale muntu yomwi yunaa aleatomwa khopuma khwa Matuunda yunaa alekhwetwaa Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Omwene aliija khovaweela vantu kenaa aleawonaa khougela welo oyoo, ili vantu vensi vakhowole khomogoomba khokelela omwene. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yohana angile akha welo oyoo, ila aleiija khovaweela vantu ganaa aleagamanyile khougela oyoo welo. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Oyoo amwenee welo wa khapanga, yunaa aleiija paliwelelo, khomomolekela kela muntu.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Mpola oyoo aleapwale kho liwelelo, khokelela omwene Matuunda aleawombaa liwelelo, ila vantu va paliwelelo alevakhakhowola khomotembola. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Aleiija kho nse yakwe mwenee, ila vantu vakwe mwenee alevakhamowawola. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ila vantu vensi vanaa alevamowawola no khomogoomba, aleavapelaa olaala ili vawee vana va Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Ewa nkha vana vanaa alevalelwa kho olaala wa vantu, ninga kho otogwi wa muntu, khwa khotogwa khwa muntu, ila khwa khotogwa khwa Matuunda mwenee.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Nanoyo Mpola alealelwaa kete muntu, ikhalaa palomwi nasu. Nasu khwawowine olaala wakwe, olaala kete Mwana aleemwi yunaa apumagaa khwa Daada, ijolagaa loojo ja Matuunda ne khapanga.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohana aleavawela vantu egoo ganaa aleagamanyile khougela Mpola oyoo, ajomaa kho lolii, apalaa, “Oyo amwene yunaa alenkhovaweela kho ituungo eloo, ‘Yunaa ijilee panaa onene amba nakelaga, amolaala khokela onene, kho nguno aleapwale panaa onene alenkhale kholelwa.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Matuunda ijolagaa loojo kho nguno manoji gakwe a masoga. Osweswe vensi khwapokelaga loojo ja Matuunda khanke ne khanke. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Matuunda aleapumya njaanga khokelela Musa, ila loojo ja Matuunda ne khapanga alejiija khokelela Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Khotopo muntu yeyensi yunaa aleamowonaa Matuunda, Ila topo Mwana aleemwi, yunaa ninga nanoyo a Matuunda. Oyoo angile alepepi no Daada, nanoyo amwene atonogajaa khomomanye Daada.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okhombe wa Yohana Mobatiji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Nsiko yemwi valaala va Vayahudi vanaa angile vapwale Yelusalemu, alevawatoma vamoonga va vapumya matambekho valaala va Matuunda ne Valawi vamowolye Yohana, “Mbi, ogwegwe a nanuu?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohana aleakhasita khovaweela, ila aleavawelaa patopo khovasweekha, “Onene nkha Kilisto yunaa aleasagolwaa no Matuunda.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Nanevo alevamowolya, “Gechoo ogwegwe a nanuu? Mbi, ogwegwe a Eliya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohana avawelaa, “Nkha gechoo, onene nkha Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Vamowolya khanke, “Mbi, ogwegwe ole mokuuni wa Matuunda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohana avawelaa, “Nkha onene.”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Apenee vamowolya, “Gechoo ogwegwe a nanuu? Khowelee mpola ya khapanga yenaa akhopeta khovaweela evoo vanaa vakhotomaga. Gechoo ogwegwe kwipalela mbi?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohana aleavawelaa khwa khotomela mpola ja mokuuni Isaya wa Matuunda, apalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">“Onene amwene lolii lwa muntu yunaa khojomaa pitenengwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Golooli njela ya Mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Vantu vanaa angile vatomagwa ne Mafalisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />nanevo vamowolya Yohana, “Mbe ogwegwee nkha Kilisto yunaa aleasagolwaa no Matuunda ao Eliya, ninga nkha mokuuni wa Matuunda, kho kee khobatijaa?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohana avawelaa, “Onene nkhobatijaa kho meje, ila apwale muntu yomwi pakhate yenyu yunaa onywenywe mokhamomanya. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Omwenee aliija ituungo nkha itale, yunaa ninga onenee nkhafwaya khotungola ninga ngosa ja ntanjee jakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Ega gensi aleganojekha ihala la Betania, nkelo ya lweje ya Yolodani khonaa Yohana alekhobatijaa.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwene Mwanankholo wa Matuunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Igolo lakwe, Yohana aleamowona Yesu khomwijelaa, apalaa, “Kunaa, Mwanankholo wa Matuunda yunaa khosolaa mabe ga liwelelo! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Oyo amwenee yunaa alenapalela mpola jakwe panaa alenavaweela, ‘Yunaa ijile panaa onene amba nakela amolaala khokela onene, kho nguno aleapwale panaa onene alenkhale.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Ninga onene alenkhamomanya kete omwenee ananuu, ila nijaga khobatija kho meje ili vantu va pa Izilaeli vamowone.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yohana aleapalaa kenaa aleawonaa, “Alenamowona Moye wa Matuunda khotelemokhaa kete njewa khopuma khochanya pa Matuunda no khosiiga palomwi nanoyo. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Onene alenkhamomanya, ila yunaa aleantoma khobatija vantu kho meje aleambwelaga, ‘Muntu yunaa olamowona khotelemokelwa no Moye waane khopuma khochanya no khosiiga palomwi nanoyo, oyoo amwenee yunaa khobatijaa kho Moye waane.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Apenee Yohana apalaa, “Onene niwonelaga ega gensi, kho khapanga nkhovaweela kete oyo amwenee Mwana wa Matuunda.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahemba va mwandyo va Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Igolo lakwe, Yohana aleimelela epoo khanke palomwi ne vahemba vakwe vawele. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Yohana panaa aleamowona Yesu khokelaa pepi nanevo, apalaa, “Kunagi! Oyoo amwenee Mwanankholo wa Matuunda.”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Vahemba evoo vawele panaa alevategeela Yohana khopalaa egoo, alevamoloonda Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Apenee Yesu aleaghalokha, avawona vantu vawele vamolondile. Avawolya, “Mokhopooga kee?” Nanevo vamowolya, “Labi, emaana yakwe Molaangi khwikhala kwenii?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu avawelaa, “Mwiije mopawone panaa nkhwikhala.” Gechoo alevapeta no khopawona panaa alekhwikhala, alevadiila nanoyo nsiko eyoo, kho nguno angile ituungo la saa ikomi ya mesee.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Mohemba yomwii kho evoo vawele vanaa alevamotegeela Yohana no khomoloonda Yesu, angile Andelea molunaakwe Simoni Petelo. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Apaponye Andelea panaa aleamowonaa Simoni Petelo molunaakwe, amowelaa, “Khwamopikhaga Masiha, yunaa aleasagolwaa no Matuunda yunaa khwetwaa Kilisto.” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Apene Andelea aleamokenkha Simon khwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu aleamokunaa Simoni no khomoweela, “Ogwegwe a Simoni, mwana wa Yohana, ila khwandelya seji khweetwa Kefa. Kefa kho Kegiliki Petelo, no Petelo emaana yakwe a mogamba.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khovasogolaa Filipo no Natanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Igolo lakwe Yesu alealomaa khopeta ihala la Galilaya, amowela Filipo, “Ndonde.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Nanoyo Filipo alekhopumela Betisaida ihala lenaa Andelea no Petelo vakhwikhala. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipo aleamopikha Natanaeli no khomoweela, “Khwamopikhaga muntu yunaa mpola jakwe alejandekhwa no Musa kho ketabu cha njaanga, ne vakuuni vinki va Matuunda alevandekha mpola jakwe. Oyo amwene Yesu, mwana wa Yusufu, nanoyo mwikhali wa ihala la Nazaleti.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaeli aleamowolya Filipo, “Mbi, kento chechensi kesoga nakekhowola khopuma Nazaleti?” Filipo amowela, “Ijoo owone.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu panaa aleamowona Natanaeli khomwijela, apalaa, “Kunagi! Oyo amwenee Mwizilaeli khapanga, atokhola opepi mokhate mwakwe.” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaeli amowolya, “Wammanya mbi?” Yesu amowela, “Panaa Filipo aleakhale akhwete panaa alewikile panse ya ipeke la motini onene alenakhowonaga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Apenee, Natanaeli aleamowela, “Molaangi, ogwegwee ole Mwana wa Matuunda! Ogwegwee ole Mwami wa Izilaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu amowela, “Mbi, wagombaga kho nguno nakhowelaga kete alenakhowona panse yi peke la motini? Olagawona minki khokela ega!” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Apenee endelelaa khovaweela, “Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, molawona khochanya khwa Matuunda khokhodigokha ne vatomami va pachanya pa Matuunda vakhotanta no khotelemokha khopuma khwa Mwana wa Muntu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Wenga kho ihala la Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Nsiko ya otato angile khole wenga kho ihala la Kana, lenaa lepwale kho nse ya Galilaya. Onyinya wa Yesu nanoyo aleapwale okhoo. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu palomwi ne vahemba vakwe, nanevo angile valalekhagwa kho wenga. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Divai panaa aleyasilaa, onyinya wa Yesu aleamowela, “Vasilelagwa ne Divai!”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu amowela, “Maye mpola eye ikhatoloma, leelo nkha nsiko yaane ya kholageela olaala waane.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Apenee onyinya wa Yesu aleavawelaa vatomami, “Lelensi lenaa alavawela motomame, tomamagi.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Epoo angile jepwale ngeelo nkolo sita jenaa alejenogeleliwe khwa khotomela mabwe, yenaa Vayahudi alekhotomela khwisinga no khosingela vento kete venaa kepogwaa khomokhombekha Matuunda. Ne ngeelo yemwii alekejolaa madebe gataano ao sita ga meje. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu avalagelelya, “Ijolaji meje mo ngeelo eje.” Apenee vijolyaa pelema. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Apenee avalagelelya, “Tapagi meje kedo momokenkele mwimeleli wa wenga.” Gechoo vatapa no khomokenkela. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Mwimeleli wa wenga panaa aleagemaa meje egoo, aleagawona meje gagalokhaga gawaaga divai. Nanoyo aleakhamanya divai khonaa aleyapumaga, ila evoo vatomami vanaa alevatapa meje egoo alevamanyile khonaa ipumile. Gechoo Mwimeleli wa wenga aleamwetaa mwenga wa kegwisha pampelo. <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />Amowela, “Kela muntu khwandyaa khopumya divai yenaa nsoga. Panaa vantu vensi amba vakholagwa, apenee vakhopumyaa divai yenaa nkha nsoga. Ila ogwegwe wapumajaa divai nsoga khwi ituungo lensi.”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ele alenee ituntumu la mwandyo lenaa Yesu aleanojaa, aleawonoja khwi ihala la Kana, yenaa ipwale kho nse ya Galilaya, alealagelaa olaala wakwe ne vahemba vakwe vamogoomba.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Panaa alegakela egoo gensi, Yesu palomwi no nyinya ne vadogwakwe ne vahemba vakwe, alevapeta Kapelenaumu khonaa alevikhala kho nsiko ntiiti.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khwopetaa kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12">Mateo 21:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maluko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45">Luka 19:45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 19:46">46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Wenga wa Pasakha wa Vayahudi angile ele pepi, gechoo Yesu aleapetaa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Panaa aleapikha kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda aleavapikha vantu vakhogolya ng'oombe, nkholo ne njewa, khanke aleavawonaa ne vantu vaange kho meza jawe vakhogalolya mpia jawe ili vapate mpia jakhotomela kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yesu aleanogelelya nkhome ya ngosa no khovadaga vantu vensi palomwi ne ng'oombe ne nkholo vapume kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda. Aleapendolaa meza ja vantu vanaa alevakhogalolya mpia no khojiita mpia jawe jeensi. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Avawela evoo vanaa alevakhogolya njewa, “Pumaji epa vento eve. Mokhainoje Nyoomba ya Daada yaane pa khogolelya no khogola vento.” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Vahemba vakwe alevakombola venaa Maandekho alegakhopaala, “Otogwi waane mo Nyoomba yakhoo otite ngulu, okhontima mokhate mwaane kete moto.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Valaala va Vayahudi alevamolya Yesu, “Olakhowola khotonojela otuntumu kee, khotolageela kete nagwe otite olaala wa khonojaa ega gensi.”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu avaweela, “Khompulagi Nyoomba eye ya Matuunda, nane ndanogelelya kho nsiko jetato.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Valaala va Vayahudi alevawolya, “Nyoomba eye ya Matuunda aleyajengwaa khwi ituungo la myakha makomi ganee ne sita. Mbi, ogwegwe olakhowola khojeenga kho nsiko jetato?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ila Nyoomba ya Matuunda yenaa Yesu angile khopalelaa a mowele gwakwe mwenee. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Panaa aleafufokhaa, vahemba vakwe alevakhombola kete angile avapalelaga mpola eye. Apenee alevagoomba Maandekho ga Matuunda ne mpola ejoo jenaa Yesu aleapalagaa.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amanyile meoyo ja vantu vensi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu panaa aleapwale Yelusalemu kho wenga wa Pasakha, vantu vinki alevamogomba panaa aleviwonela matuntumu ganaa aleaganojaa. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ila Yesu angile akhavagombela, kho nguno aleagamanyile ga momeoyo jawe. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Angile akhaloma muntu yeyensi amowelee venaa vantu vapwale, kho nguno Yesu aleamanyile masiimo gensi ga vantu evoo.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Nikodemo khomogendelaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Aleapwale muntu yomwi pi idale la Mafalisayo, lina lakwe angile Nikodemo, nanoyo angile mokhombe kho ivanza ikolo la Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Nsiko yemwi Nikodemo aleamopetela Yesu otikho amowelaa, “Molaangi, khomanyile kete ogwegwe ole molaangi yunaa opumile khwa Matuunda, kho nguno khotopo muntu yunaa nokhokhowola khonoja matuntumu ganaa ogwegwe khonojaa ninga mbe Matuunda atapoya palomwi nanoyo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu amowelaa, “Nkhokhoweela khapanga, khotopo muntu yunaa nowaa kho wami wa Matuunda, mbe akhalelwa kho mala ya owele.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemo amowolyaa, “Kekhowolekha mbi muntu yeyensi alelwe panaa awagaa mokolo? Mbi muntu nokhowolaa khwingela mondaa ya nyinya no kholelwa khanke?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu amowelaa, “Nkhokhoweela khapanga, mbe muntu akhalelwa kho meje no kho Moye wa Matuunda, khotopo iikhale kho wami wa Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Muntu kholelwaa keontu khopuma khwa valeli vakwe, no muntu yunaa alelagwa khwa Moye wa Matuunda khowaa no wome wa kemoye. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Okhakumye venaa nakhowelaga, okhopogiwaa olelwee mala ya owele. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Iputa lekhoputa khopeta khwekwensi khonaa letogwile. Okhoitegela lolii lwakwe, ila okhamanya khonaa opumile ninga panaa okhopeta. Avyenee venaa ipwale khwa muntu yunaa alelwagwa kho Moye wa Matuunda.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemo amowolya, “Mbi ega gensi gakhokowolekha mbi?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu amowelaa, “Ogwegwe ole molaangi kho nse ya Izilaeli. Mbi ega gensi okhagamanya? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Nkhokoweela khapanga, osweswe khokovaweela ganaa khogamanyile no khopaala ganaa khogawine, ila onywenywe mokhosiita egoo ganaa alekhwagawona no khovaweela. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Mbe okhakhongoomba panaa nkhokhoweela mpola ja paliwelelo, olangomba mbi, mbe ndakhoweela mpola ja pachanya pa Matuunda? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Khotopo muntu yunaa aleatantaa khopeta khochanya pa Matuunda, ila topo Mwana wa Muntu, yunaa atelemokha khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />“Kete venaa Musa aleapagikhaa njokha ya shaba no khomonyanyola pachanya pitenengwa, avivyoo no Mwana wa Muntu venaa khopogiwa apagikwe khochanya pa mosalaba, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />ili kela muntu yunaa khomogombaa awee no opanga wa nsiko jensi. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Gechoo Matuunda aleavatogwa vantu va liwelelo lensi ninga amopumya Mwanaakwe aleemwi, ili kela muntu yunaa khomogombaa akhapwele, ila awee no opanga wa nsiko jensi. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kho nguno Matuunda aleakhamotoma Mwanaakwe paliwelo ili avatengemeke vantu, ila aleamotomaa ili avapon'ye vantu va paliwelelo khopuma kho mabe.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />“Muntu yeyensi yunaa khomogombaa no khwisowelela Mwana wa Matuunda akhakhotengemekhwa, ila yunaa akhakhomogombaa khatengemekhwa, kho nguno aleakhamogomba Mwana aleemwi wa Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Itengemekho yenee ayenee eye, welo wijaga kho vantu va paliwelelo, ila vantu vakhotogwa kiiti khokela welo, kho nguno manoji gawe a mabe. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Kela muntu yunaa khonojaa mabe khosimbila welo, akhakhwijaa kho welo, kho nguno akhatogwa manoji gakwe giigele. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Ila muntu yeyensi yunaa khonojaa ganaa gakhapanga, khwijaa kho welo, ili egoo ganaa aganogajaa giigele kete Matuunda avapelaga olaala wa khonojaa.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mobatiji khopalela mpola ja Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Panaa alegakela egoo, Yesu palomwi ne vahemba vakwe alevapeta kho ihala ikolo la Yudea, no okhoo Yesu aleikhalaa palomwi ne vahemba vakwe, no okhoo angile khobatijaa vantu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Avivyoo Yohana alekhobatijaa vantu okhoo Ainoni pepi ne ihala la Salemu, kho nguno okhoo angile khole meje minki. Vantu vinki angile vakhomopetela kho nguno ya khobatijwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Kho ituungo eloo Yohana angile akhale akhatungwa mo khandulunge.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Nsiko yemwi vamoonga va vahemba va Yohana no Moyahudi yomwi angile vakhwisitelya kho mpola ya khokalawa ili khonojwaa khomokumbekha Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Apenee vahemba evoo alevamopetela Yohana no khomoweela, “Molaangi, muntu oyoo yunaa angile alepalomwi nagwe kho nkelo ya lweje ya Yolodani, oyoo yunaa alewakhoweela mpola jenaa ojemanyile khomougela omwene, seji nanoyo khobatijaa vantu, ne kela muntu khomopetelaa.” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohana avawelaa, “Khotopo muntu yunaa nokhowola khonojaa kento chechensi, ila topo mbe apelagwa no Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Onywenywe venee momanyile kete alenavaweela, ‘Onenee akha Kilisto, ila natomagwaa khomolongolaa.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mwenga wa kekhiima amwenee wakwe mwenga wa kegwisha. Molaasi yunaa khomosindekelya mwenga wa kegwisha yunaa apwale pepi nanoyo no khotegelelya ganaa khopalaa, khosekelela modugo panaa khotegelaa lolii lwakwe. Kho nguno eye nsekho yaane yadugamaga. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Omwene khopogiwa awee molaala mokolo, nane nendelele khowaa modo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oyoo yunaa ijile khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda a molaala khokela vensi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Omwenee yunaa asagolagwa khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda a molaala khokela yeyensi oyoo. Muntu wa paliwelelo khopalaa ganaa agamanyile ga epa paliwelelo, ila Yesu yunaa khopuma khwa Matuunda amwenee khwimelela gensi kho lwande yeyensi eyoo. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Omwenee khotowelaa egoo ganaa aleagawona no khogategeela pachanya khwa Matuunda, ila khotopo muntu yunaa khogombaa mpola jakwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ila muntu yeyensi yunaa khogombaa okhombe wakwe, kholagelaa kete mpola ja Matuunda ajenee ja khapanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Yunaa aleatomagwa no Matuunda khopala mpola ja Matuunda topo, kho nguno Matuunda amopelaga Moye wakwe kho winki. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Daada amotogwile Mwana, nanoyo amopelaga vento vyensi vewee momekhono jakwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khomogombaa Mwana atite opanga wa nsiko jensi, ila muntu yeyensi yunaa akhakhomogombaa Mwana atokhola opanga wa nsiko jensi, ne gechoo valalekha vakhakembela kesila cha Matuunda.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khopalaa no mokhiima khopuma Samalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Yesu panaa aleamanyaa kete Mafalisayo vategelaga kete khokongany'aa no khobatijaa vahemba vinki khokela Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Kho khapanga nkha Yesu yunaa angile khobatijaa, ila vahemba vakwe avenee vanaa angile vakhobatija. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Kho gechoo Yesu palomwi ne vahemba aleavawookha kho nse ya Yudea no khotuuwa kho nse ya Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Kho mosingi gwakwe aleyamopogaa akelele kho nse ya Samalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Yesu apikhaa panaa pakwetwa Sikali, kho nse ya Samalia. Epoo angile pepi no mogoonda gonaa Yakhobo aleamopelaga mwanaakwe Yusufu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Ne isima la Yakhobo angile lepwale epoo. Yesu angile akhatalaga kho nguno ya mosingi, gechoo aleibwetekhaa panse pampelo ne isima eloo. Ituungo eloo lyonse angile lapikhaga pakhate.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Apenee mokhiima yomwi wa khopuma Samalia aleiija khotapa meje. Yesu amowelaa, “Nkholoomba meje ng'weele.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Ituungo eloo vahemba vakwe alevapetaga khwi ihala khogula endya.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Mokhiima oyoo Mosamalia aleamowelaa, “Ogwegwe a Moyahudi, nane nde Mosamalia, kho kee khondoomba meje?” Aleapalaa gechoo, kho nguno Vayahudi alevakhasalenkanaga ne vantu va Samalia kho vento vyawe.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu amowelaa, “Mbe angaomanye mfinga yenaa alakhopela Matuunda, no ananuu yunaa khokowelaa mpelee meje ng'weele, anga omoloombe nanoyo anga khakopelaa meje ganaa gakhokhonoja owee no opanga.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mokhiima oyoo amowelaa, “Meyaa, ogwegwe otokhola igegele la khotapela meje khopuma mwisima, ne isima ele a itale. Olapata khwenii meje ganaa gatite opanga? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Mbi ogwegwe ole molaala khokela okoko wisu Yakhobo yunaa akhopelaga isima ele? Yakhobo mwenee palomwi ne vana vakwe ne metugo yakwe angile vakhong'weela meje ga isima ele.”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu amowelaa, “Yeyensi yunaa khong'welaa meje khopuma mwisima ele, alategelaa nyoota khanke. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Ila vensi vanaa valang'wela meje ganaa ndavapela onene, valalekha khotegeela nyoota khanke. Meje ganaa ndavapela onene, galaawa gakholyela mokhate mwawe, no khomopeela opanga wa nsiko jensi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mokhiima oyoo amowelaa Yesu, “Meyaa, nane mpelee meje egoo ng'weele, ili nkhiije ntegeele nyoota khanke no khwijaa epa khotapa meje khanke.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu amowelaa, “Petaa omwete mogwisha wakhoo, wiije nanoyo epa.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mokhiima oyoo amowelaa, “Onene ntokhola mogwisha.” Yesu amowela, “Wapalaga avyenee kete ogwegwe otokhola mogwisha. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kho nguno wawaga ne vagwisha vataano, no yunaa khwikhala nanoyo kho seji nkha mogwisha wakhoo. Kenaa wapalaga achenee cha khapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mokhiima oyoo amowelaa, “Meyaa, nkhowona kete ogwegwe ole mokuuni wa Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Vakoko visu alevakhwikumbeka kho ketonda eke, ila onywenywe Vayahudi mokhopaala kete Yelusalemu akhwene vantu vakhopogiwa khopeta khomokumbekha Matuunda.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu amowelaa, “Mokhiima, gombaa kenaa nkhopaala, ituungo lijile lenaa molakumbekha Daada, ila nkha pachanya ya ketonda eke, ninga okhoo Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Onywenywe Vasamalia mokhamanya yunaa mokhomokhombekha, ila osweswe Vayahudi khomomanyile yunaa khokhomokhombekha, kho nguno opon'ye okhopuma kho Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ituungo lijile, ne seji lapikhaga, panaa vantu vakhomokumbekha Daada khwa khapanga, valamokhombekha Daada khopuma kho meoyo jawe okho vakhovambela okhapanga. Kho nguno Daada khovapogaa vantu kete evoo vamokumbekhe. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Matuunda amwenee Moye, kho gechoo evoo vanaa vakhomokumbekha, vakhopogiwaa khomokumbekha khopuma kho meoyo jawe okho vakhovambelela okhapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mokhiima oyoo amowelaa, “Manyile kete Masiya ijile. Nanoyo amwenee Kilisto yunaa aleasagolwa no Matuunda, nanoyo panaa aliija alatowelaa vento vyensi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu amowelaa, “Onene yunaa khopalaa nagwe epa, amwenee oyoo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Ituungo aleloo vahemba vakwe alevatuuwa, nanevo alevakhumya kho nguno alevamowona Yesu khopalaa ne mokhiima oyoo. Ila khotopo yunaa aleawolyaa, “Khopooga kee?” Ao, “Kho kee khopaala no mokhiima oyo?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Apenee mokhiima oyoo angile ailekhaa ngeelo yakwe ya meje epoo, no khotuuwa khwi ihala, okhoo alevawelaa vantu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Khopetage momowone muntu yunaa aleambwela mpola jensi jenaa alenajenojaa. Mbi, oyo amba nkha amwenee Masiya?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Gechoo vantu alevapuma khwi ihala, vapeta khomowona Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Ituungo aleloo vahemba vakwe alevakhomoweela Yesu, “Molaangi, khokholoomba olyee taali.”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ila Yesu avawelaa, “Onene ntite endya yenaa onywenywe mokhakemanya.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Apenee vahemba vakwe alevandya khwiwolya venee khwa venee, “Mbi, khole muntu yeyensi yunaa amoletelagaa endya?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu avawelaa, “Endya yaane a khonojaa egoo ganaa Matuunda khogatogwaa, no khomala molemo gwakwe gonaa aleantomaa. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Mbi, onywenywe mokhamokhopaala, ‘Ikhale miyeli jenee topo khokungule?’ Ila onene khovaweela kunagi vantu venaa vakhonijela, vale kete, velewaa venaa vyapikelaga khokongolwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Mokongoli kholepwaa, nanoyo khokongan'yaa velewaa, nanevo avenee vantu vanaa valapokela opanga wa nsiko jensi, gechoo movyali no mokongoli vakhosekelela palomwi. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Gechoo opaali wonaa okhopaala a wa khapanga, ‘Yomwii khovyala no yoonge khokongola.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Onene alenavatoma mokhongole velewaa venaa alemokhavyala wenee. Vantu vaange alevagatomamela melemo mekhamu, nanywi mokholepwa khopumana ne melemo jawe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Vasamalia vinki kho ihala eloo alevamogoomba Yesu, kho nguno mokhiima oyoo angile avawelagaa, “Muntu oyoo ambwelagaa kela kento kenaa alenakenogajaa.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Gechoo evoo Vasamalia alevamopetela Yesu vamoloomba ikhale nanevo, nanoyo ikhalaa nanevo kho nsiko jewele.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Kho nsiko ejoo vantu vinki alevamogoomba Yesu kho nguno ya okhombe wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Apenee vamoweela mokhiima oyoo, “Seji khokogoomba, nkha kho nguno ya mpola yenaa alewakhowelaga topo, ila khwamotegelaga osweswe venee, seji khomanyile kete oyo amwenee Moponi wa liwelelo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopon'ya mwana wa Mwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Panaa alejakela ejoo nsiko jewele, Yesu aleawokha Samalia apetaa kho nse ya Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yesu aleavawela patokhola khovasweekha, “Mokuuni wa Matuunda akhakhokoliwa kho nse yakwe mwenee.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Panaa aleapikhaa kho nse ya Galilaya, Vagalilaya vinki alevamopokeela, kho nguno alevagawona minki ganaa aleaganogajaa kho wenga owoo wa Pasakha, kho nguno nanevo alevapwale okhoo Yelusalumu ituungo la wenga owoo.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yesu aleapeta khanke okhoo khwi ihala la Kana lenaa lepwale kho nse ya Galilaya, khonaa angile agalelolya meje khowa divai. Okhoo angile khole Mwami yunaa mwanaakwe angile molwile, nanoyo angile agonaga kho ihala la Kapelanaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Mwami oyoo panaa aleategela kete Yesu aleapikhaga Galilaya. Gechoo aleamopetela Yesu no khomoloomba apete nanoyo Kapelanaumu ili apete amopon'ye mwanaakwe, yunaa angile alepepi afwee. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu amowelaa mwami oyoo, “Mbe, onywenywe molalekha khowona lomekho ne matuntumu, khotopo mwiije mogoombe nsiko jensi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Mwami oyoo amowelaa, “Meyaa, nkhokholoomba khopete nagwe panaa Mwanaane akhale afwee.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu amowelaa, “Petagaa topo, mwanakhoo aponagaa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Apenee Mwami oyoo aleagombaa mpola ja Yesu no khwandya khotuuwa khokhaye. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Panaa aleakhale alemonjela, alevitaanga ne vasi vakwe, nanevo vamoweela kete mwanaakwe aponagaa. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Mwami oyoo aleavawolya, Ituungo kee lenaa molomyana waane aleapona, “Nanevo vamoweela, anga igolo saa saba ja lyonse, apenee homa aleyamolekolaga.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Apenee Mwami oyoo aleakhombolaa kete ituungo eloo alenee Yesu aleamowelagaa, “Mwanakhoo aponaga.” Gechoo omwenee palomwi ne vantu va khokhayaakwe alevamogoomba Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Eloo angile ituntumu la owele lenaa Yesu aleanogajaa panaa alekhopuma Yudea khopeta Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopony'a molema wa megolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khonojaa egoo okhoo Kana, aleapetaa Yelusalemu kho wenga wa Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Okhoo Yelusalemu pepi no molyango gonaa alegokhwetwa Molyango gwa Nkholo, angile khole iwoga la meje kho Kiebulania angile lekhwetwaa Betizata, lenaa alelepilimilwe ne mavanza gataano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Kho mavanza egoo valwile vinki alevagonile pampelo pi iwoga la meje, ne valwile evoo vamoonga vawe angile vatulu, valema va megolo ne vanaa alevapolile mowele. Angile valindile meje gaguluungwe, <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />ituungo leenge motomami wa pachanya pa Matuunda alekhotelemokela moiwoga no khogaguluunga meje. Molwile yeyensi yunaa kholongolaa khwingela momeje panaa meje alagagulungagwa, aleaponaa olwile wensi wonaa atite. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Mo vamoonga vawe aleapwale mogwisha yomwi yunaa angile molwile kho ituungo lya myakha makomi gatato ne menaane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu panaa aleamowonaa molwile oyoo agonile epoo, okho amanyilee kete oyo angile molwile khwi ituungo itale, gechoo aleamowolya, “Mbi, khopooga khopona?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Molwile oyoo amowelaa, “Meyaa, ntokhola muntu yunaa khonyingelyaa mo iwoga, panaa meje gakhowa gagulungagwaa. Panaa nkhopooga khwingela, muntu yoonge khondongolaa khwingela mo iwoga.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu amowelaa, “Imelelaa, solaa mokekha gwakhoo, owooke.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Apaponye muntu oyoo aleaponaa, imelela, asolaa mokekha gwakwe awokhaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Mpola eye aleyanojekhaa Nsiko ya Khosuupa. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Gechoo valaala va Vayahudi alevamoweela muntu yunaa aleaponyajwaa, “Leelo a Nsiko ya Khosuupa, njaanga yisu jekhaloma ogwegwe khokepola mokekha.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Ila omwene aleavawelaa, “Muntu yunaa aleamponya amwene yunaa aleambwela, solaa mokekha gwakhoo owooke.” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Nanevo alevamowolya, “Mbi, ananuu yunaa akhowelaa osole mokekha gwakhoo owooke?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Ila muntu yunaa angile aponyajwa angile akhamomanya muntu yunaa angile amoponyajaa, kho nguno vantu angile vinki, Yesu aleanyelemokhaa.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Mpola eje panaa angile jakela, Yesu aleampikhaa muntu oyoo kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda. Amowelaa, “Tegelelyaa, seji waponaga. Okhanojage khanke mabe, okhiije ovambwee khanke ne mabe khokela egoo ganaa angile otite.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Epoo papenee muntu oyoo aleawokhaa, apetaa khovaweela valaala va Vayahudi kete Yesu amwenee yunaa angile amoponyajaa.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Gechoo Vayahudi alevandya khomogayanja Yesu, kho nguno angile khonojaa mpola eyoo lsiko la Khosuupa. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu aleavawelaa, “Daada yaane khotomama molemo nsiko jensi, nane nkhotomama melemo nsiko jensi.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kho egoo ganaa aleanogaja, valaala va Vayahudi alevandya khopooga njela ya khomoolaga Yesu. Alevanoja gechoo nkha kholekha kholoonda njaanga ya Nsiko ya Khosuupa topo, ila avivyoo alekhomwetaa Matuunda Ise. Gechoo alekhwinojaa alekete Matuunda.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olaala wa Mwana wa Matuunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu avawelaa, “Nkhovaweela kho khapanga, kete Mwana wa Matuunda khotopo anojee kento chechensi kete venaa khwiwonela mwenee. Ila khonojaa topo egoo ganaa khomowona Ise khoganojaa. Chechensi kenaa kekhonojwaa no Daada, Mwana nanoyo khonojaa avivyoo. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Kho nguno Daada khomotogwa Mwana, nanoyo khomolageela gensi ganaa khonojaa. Nanoyo alamolagela melemo jenaa mekolo khokela eje, ili mokhowole khokumiwa nanejo. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Kete venaa Daada khovafufola vantu no khovapeela opanga, avivyoo ninga Mwana khomopeela opanga yeyensi yunaa amotogwilee. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Daada akhakomotengemekhaa muntu yeyensi, ila amopelagaa Mwana olaala wa khotengemekha vantu vensi. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Ili vantu vensi vakhowole khomokolya Mwana kete venaa vakhomokholya Daada. Yeyensi yunaa akhakhomotegelelya Mwana amotegelelye Daada yunaa amotomagaa.”<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Nkhovawela khwa khapanga, yeyensi yunaa khotegeela mpola yaane no khomogoomba yunaa antomagaa atite opanga wa nsiko jensi no akhakhotengemekhwaa. Seji nkha mochi khanke, ila a mopanga. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, ituungo lijile, ne ituungo eloo lapikhaga, lenaa vantu vanaa vafwiile valategela lolii lwa Mwana wa Matuunda, nanevo valafufokha ne valaawa no opanga wa nsiko jensi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Kete venaa Daada amwenee mwandyo wa opanga, avyenee ninga Mwanaakwe amopelegaa mwandyo wa opanga nsiko jensi. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Nanoyo amopelaga Mwanaakwe olaala wa khotengemekha, kho nguno omwenee amwenee muntu wa yunaa Matuunda amotomaga. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mokhakumye mpola eye, ituungo lijile panaa vantu vensi vanaa vapwale momakhabuli, valategeela lolii lwakwe, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />vensi valapuma momakhabuli gawe. Evoo vanaa alevakhonoja masoga avenee valafokha no khopelwaa opanga nsiko jensi, ila evoo vanaa alevakhonoja mabe valafufokha no khotengemekhwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vawoni va Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Onene nkhakhonojaa mpola yeyensi kete venaa nkhopooga, onene nkhotengemekha vantu kete venaa Matuunda khotogwaa, ne nkhotengemekha patokhola khosagoola, kho nguno nkhakhonoja venaa onenee nkhotogwaa, ila nkhonoja ganaa khotogwaa yunaa aleantoma.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Mbe anga mpaale ganaa manyile khwiwugela nenee, ganaa nkhopaala anga amba akha ga khapanga. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Ila apwale yunaa khopalaa ganaa agamanyile khombugela onenee, ganaa gakholageela kete ganaa nkhopaala agenee ga khapanga, nane manyile kete mpola jakwe ajenee ja khapanga.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Onywenywe alemwavatoma vakhombe vapete khwa Yohana Mobatiji, nanoyo avawelagaa mpola ja khapanga jenaa amanyile khombugela onene. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Onene nkhaloma khomanyikha khopumana ne egoo ganaa muntu khopalaa khombugela onene, ninga gechoo nkhovaweela ganaa aleapalaa Yohana, ili mokhowole khoponiwaa. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana angile kete etala yenaa alekewakhaa no khopumya welo, nanywi alemokhosekelela welo gwakwe khwi ituungo ikupe. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Ila ambawela mpola nkolo jenaa alenajiwona khokela jenaa aleavawelaa Yohana, kho nguno melemo jenaa ampela Daada ili njimale, melemo ejoo jenaa nkhonojaa, jekholageela kete Daada antomagaa. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Daada yaane yunaa aleantoma apalagaa khapanga khombugela onene. Onywenywe mokhale motegeele lolii lwakwe ninga khogowona osho wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Mokhamokhogagoomba visoga mpola jenaa khopalaa, kho nguno mokhamokhomogoomba oyoo yunaa aleamotomaa. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Onywenywe mokhoyakunelelya Maandekho ga Matuunda kho nguno mokhosiima khopumana nanego molapata opanga wa nsiko jensi. Ila Maandekho agagoo agenee gakhompalela onene. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Ninga gechoo, onywenywe mokhosiita khwija khwane ili mopate opanga nsiko jensi.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Onene nkhaloma vantu vampele olaala. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Ila onene mbamanyile onywenywe venaa mokhamotogwa Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Onene nijaga khwenyu ili mpaale egoo ganaa Daada yaane khopogaa mpaale, ila onywenywe mokhonsiita. Ila mbe muntu yoonge yeyensi khiija patokhola khotomwa no muntu yeyensi, onywenywe molamopokela. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Onywenywe motogwile khwikholya nywenywe kho nywenywe. Ila mokhatogwa khopokela okolo khopuma khwa Matuunda mwenee. Gechoo molakhowola mbi khongoomba onene? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Mokhasiime kete onenee ampeta khovasitacha khwa Daada, ila Musa yunaa mokhwisowelela amwenee alavasitacha. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Mbe alemwamogoomba Musa kho khapanga, anga mongoombe nane, kho nguno omwenee aleandekha mpola jaane. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ila mbe mokhagagomba ganaa aleandekhaa Musa, molakhowala mbi khogagomba ganaa gechoo ninga ganaa nkhovaweela khotopo mogagombe?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khovapelaa endya vantu elufu jetaano.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Panaa alegakela egoo, Yesu alealowokha kho nkelo yiilambo la Galilaya, khanke angile lekhwetwa iilambo la Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Idale ikolo la vantu angile lekhomoloonda kho nguno alevawona lomekho jenaa aleanojaa khwa khovapon'ya valwile. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Apenee Yesu aleatantaa kho ketonda no khwikhala okhoo palomwi ne vahemba vakwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Nsiko ejoo, wenga wa Pasakha wa Vayahudi alewatelelaga. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu panaa aleakunaa, aleawona idale ikolo la vantu lekhomopetela, amowolya Filipo, “Akhogola kwenii endya jakhovakhwela vantu vensi ewa?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yesu aleamowolya Filipo gechoo ili amogeme, kho nguno omwene aleamanyile lenaa alanoja.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo amowelaa, “Ninga vebaande magana gawele ga madini ga mpia jekhakwela khovagolela endya vantu vensi ewa.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Yomwi wa vahemba vakwe yunaa alekhwetwaa Andelea, yunaa angile molunaakwe Simoni Petelo, amowelaa Yesu, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Epa pale no molomyana yomwi yunaa atite mikate jetaano ja ngano ne nshe jewele, ila evee vikhakwela kho vantu vinki kete ewa.”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu apalaa, “Vawelegi vantu vensi vikhale panse.” Epoo alepatite masanje masapu minki, kho gechoo vantu alevikhala panse ne vagwisha alevapwale kete elufu jetaano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu aleaesolaa mikate eyoo no khosongela khwa Matuunda, apenee andyaa khovagawela vantu vanaa angile vikhalaga epoo, anojaa aviyoo no kho nshe ejoo, kela muntu aleapataa kete venaa alekhopoga.<verse eid="JHN 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Vantu vensi panaa alevikhota, Yesu aleavawela vahemba vakwe, “Solangelagi masigelo gensi, kekhapwele chechensi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Gechoo alevasolangela masigelo gensi no khwijolya vekhapu ikomi ne vewele vya mikate yenaa alevalya vantu.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Vantu panaa alevawona lomekho eyoo yenaa Yesu aleaenogajaa, vandya khopaala, “Khapanga oyo amwenee alaawa mukuuni wa Matuunda yunaa iijile paliwelelo.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu panaa aleatembola kete vantu vakhopooga vamonojee awee mwami wawe kho ngulu, aleanyelemokhaa no khopeta kho ketonda aleemwi.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khogendaa pachanya ya meje</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mateo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maluko 6:45-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Lyonse panaa angile lagweela, vahemba vakhwe alevasulumokela khwi ilambo la Galilaya, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />alevataanta mwipogo ili valowokhe khopeta Kapelanaumu, otikho angile wingelega, no Yesu angile akhale apikhe. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Iputa ikhakha alelandya khoputa vekhamu, apenee alegapumeela magelekha makolo ga meje. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Vahemba panaa alevapetaga ne ipogo otale wa kilomita jetaano ao sita, alevamowona Yesu khogendaa pachanya ya meje khotelela pipogo, epoo alevatungumala modugo. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Ila Yesu avawelaa, “Nenee, mokhatungumale.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Apenee vamopooga ataante mwipogo. Apaponye ipogo yawaa yapikhaga kho nse nkhaku khonaa alevaile.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vantu vakhomopooga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Igolo lakwe idale la vantu vanaa alevasigaga lwande yeenge ya ilambo alevaewona ipogo yemwi topo yasigaga. Khanke alevawona kete Yesu angile akhapeta palomwi ne vahemba vakwe. Ila vahemba vakwe avenee vanaa alevapeta ne ipogo valeemwi. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Mapogo gaange khopuma Tibelia alegapikha pepi ne epoo khonaa vantu alevalyelaga mikate ejoo, panaa Mwene aleamalagaa khomosongela Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Vantu panaa alevawona kete Yesu ne vahemba vakwe angile vatapoyaa epoo, alevingela kho mapogo gawe khopeta Kapelanaumu khomopooga Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwenee endya ya opanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Vantu panaa alevamowona Yesu nkelo ya ilambo vamowolya, “Molaangi, epa alewapikha nale?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu aleavawelaa, “Nkhovawela khwa khapanga, monkhopooga onene nkha kho nguno ja lomekho jenaa alemwawonaga, ila onenee manyile kete mokhompooga kho nguno alemwalya mekhate eyoo no khwikota. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Mokhagayele endya kenaa kekhononekha, ila gailagi endya yenaa kekholeeta opanga wa nsiko jensi. Echoo achenee endya kenaa Mwana wa Muntu alavapela, kho nguno Daada Matuunda andagelaga onene amwenee.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Apenee vamowolya, “Mbi, khonojee chanuu ili khokhowole khonojaa melemo ja Matuunda?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu avawelaa, “Molemo gonaa Matuunda khopogaa monojee, a khomogoomba oyoo yunaa amotomaga.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Gechoo vamowolya, “Olatunojela lomekho kee ili khowone no khokhogoomba? Mbi olanoja ituntumu kee? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Vakoko visu alevalya endya jenaa alejekhwetwa mana okhoo pitenengwa, kete venaa Maandekho ga Matuunda venaa gakhopaala, ‘Aleavapelaa endya khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu avawelaa, “Nkovaweela khwa khapanga, nkha Musa yunaa aleavapela endya khopuma khochanya pa Matuunda, ila Daada yaane amwenee yunaa khovapelaa endya ya khapanga khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kho nguno endya kenaa Matuunda khovapela akechoo kenaa kekhotelemokha khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda no khovapeela vantu va paliwelo opanga nsiko wa nsiko jensi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Apenee vamowelaa, “Meyaa, okhopelage endya eye nsiko jensi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu avawelaa, “Onenee amwenee endya kenaa kekhovapela vantu opanga wa jelele. No muntu yeyensi yunaa khwijaa khwaane khotopo ategeele njala, no oyoo yonaa khongombaa khotopo ategeele nyoota khanke. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Ila alenavawelaga, mwambonaga ila mokhamokhongoomba. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Vantu vensi vanaa Daada khompela, valiija khwaane, ne yeyensi yunaa khwijaa khwaane khotopo mbosombe ninga nsiko yemwii. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Kho nguno onene natelemokhaga khopuma khochanya pa Matuunda, nkha kho nguno ya khonoja ganaa onene nkhopooga, ila nijaga khonojaa ganaa Matuunda khopogaa. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Ega agenee khogapoga oyoo yunaa aleantoma, kete nkhamopwele ninga muntu yomwi movamooga va evoo vanaa aleampelaa, ila mbafufole vensi nsiko ya odugo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kenaa khopogaa Daada yaane achenee eke, yeyensi yunaa khomowonaa Mwana no khomogoomba, khaawa no opanga wa nsiko jensi. Nane ndamofufola nsiko ya odugo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Apenee vamoonga va Vayahudi alevandya khomololomela Yesu kho nguno aleapalaa, “Onene amwenee endya yenaa ketelemokhaa khopuma khochanya pa Matuunda.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Vapaala, “Mbi, oyo nkha mwana wa Yusufu? Khomomanyile ise no nyinya, seji khokhowolaa mbi khopaala kete atelemokhaa khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu avawelaa, “Lekhagi khong'ung'uunta nywenywe khwa nywenywe. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Khotopo muntu yunaa nokhowolaa kwijaa khwaane, mbe Daada yunaa aleantomaa akhamolongolya khomoleeta khwaane, nane ndamofufola nsiko ya odugo. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Vakuuuni va Matuunda alevandekha, ‘Vantu vensi valaligwa no Matuunda.’ Kela muntu yunaa ategelagaa no khwiliga khopuma khwa Daada, amwenee yunaa aliija khwaane. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Khotopo muntu yeyensi yunaa aleakhowola khomowona Daada Matuunda, ila topo oyoo yunaa aletelemokha khopuma khwa Matuunda, oyoo amwenee aleemwi yunaa aleamowonaa Daada. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, yeyensi yunaa khongombaa, oyoo amwenee khaawa no opanga wa nsiko jensi. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Onene amwenee endya ya opanga wa nsiko jensi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Vakoko venyu alevalya endya jenaa alejekwetwa mana okhoo pitenengwa, ila angile vafwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Eye ayenee endya kenaa kekhotelemokha khopuma khochanya pa Matuunda, ili muntu apate kholya ne akhafwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Onene amwenee endya ya opanga yenaa kekhotelemokha khopuma khochanya pa Matuunda. Yeyensi yunaa khaalya endya eyoo alaawa no alikhala nsiko jensi. Endya yenaa nkhopumya onene a mowele gwaane, gonaa nkhopumya khwa vantu vensi va paliwelo.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Apenee Vayahudi alevandya khwisookha khwa kesila. “Muntu oyoo khakhowola mbi khopumyaa mowele gwakwe kholyee?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu avawelaa, “Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, mbe molalekha kholya mowele gwa Mwana wa Muntu no khong'weela chaji yakwe, molaawa motokhola opanga wa nsiko jensi mokhate mwenyu. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Muntu yunaa kholyaa mowele gwaane no khong'weela chaji yaane, oyoo khaawa ne opanga wa nsiko jensi, gechoo nane ndamofufola nsiko ya odugo. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kho nguno mowele gwaane agwene endya ya khapanga ne chaji yaane a keng'weela cha khapanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa kholya mowele gwane no khong'weela chaji yaane, alaikhala mokhate yaane, nane ndikhala mokhate mwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Kete venaa Daada yunaa aleantomaa venaa atite opanga, nane nkhwikhala khwa njela yakwe, avyenee yeyensi yunaa khondyaa alikhala khwa njela yaane. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Gechoo, eye ayenee endya yenaa yatelemokhaga khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda, kekhakekhwipya ne endya yenaa alevalya vakoko venyu, nanevo vafwaa. Ila muntu yeyensi yunaa kholyaa endya eye, khotopo afwe, ila alikhala nsiko jensi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu aleapalaa gechoo, panaa alekholigaa kho nyoomba yenaa Vayahudi angile vakhwitangela okhoo Kapelanaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vahemba vaange vakhomolekha Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Vahemba vakwe vinki panaa alevategeela mpola ejoo, vapaala, “Malaangi ega a makhamu. Mbi ananuu yunaa nokhowolaa khogapokeela?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu aleamanya kete vahemba vakwe alevakhololoma kho nguno ya malaangi gakwe, gechoo avawolya, “Mbi, malaangi ega gakhovanoja molekhe khongoomba? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ilaawa mbi panaa molamowona Mwana wa Muntu khopapamokha khopeta khochanya khwa Matuunda khonaa angile apwale pamwandyo? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Moye wa Matuunda amwenee kholetaa opanga wa nsiko jensi. Muntu khotopo akhowole khonojaa chechensi kho ngulu jakwe topo. Mpola yenaa navawelaga gakhovanoja mopate Moye wa Matuunda yunaa khovapelaa opanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Ila movamoonga venyu vapwale vaange vanaa akhavakhongoomba.” Kho nguno Yesu aleavamanyaa khopuma pamwandyo vananuu vanaa akhavakhomogoomba ne aleamomanyaa yunaa alamogalokha. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Yesu aleendelelaa khovaweela, “Avyenee alenavawelaa, muntu yunaa alakhowola khwijaa khwaane mbe Daada akhamolongolya iije khwaane.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Khwa khopaala gechoo, vahemba vakwe vinki alevalekha khomoloonda, no kholekha khopeta nanoyo kho mosingi gwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Apenee Yesu aleavawolya vahemba evoo ikomi ne vawele vanaa angile avasagolaa, “Mbi, nanyu mokhopooga khowookha?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petelo amowelaa, “Mwene, akhopeta khwa ananuu? Ogwegwe otite mpola jenaa jekhotoletela opanga wa nsiko jensi. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Osweswe khokhogoomba no khomanyile kete ogwegwe ole wa Matuunda no watomagwa no Matuunda.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu avawelaa, “Mbi, angile nkhavasagola onywenywe ikomi ne vawele? Ila yomwi wenyu a Khatawe.” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu angile khomopalela Yuda, mwana wa Simoni Isikaliote, ninga venaa Yuda angile yomwi wa vahemba ikomi ne vawele, amwenee yunaa angile apetile khomogalokha.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khositaa khopeta Yelusalmu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Panaa egoo alegakela, Yesu aleagendela mahala minki ga nse ya Galilaya. Aleakhaloma khopeta kho mahala ga nse ya Yudea, kho nguno valaala va Vayahudi alevakhopooga khomowologa. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Ituungo eloo wenga wa Vayahudi wa vidindiga angile watelelaga. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Apenee vadogo va Yesu alevamowelaa, “Wokhaa epa opete Yudea ili vahemba vakhoo vawone matuntumu ganaa khoganojaa. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Khotopo muntu yunaa khopogaa amanyike khwa khonoja mpola khwa khwisweekha. Mbe khonojaa mpola eje, wilageele kho vantu va paliwelo.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Valunakwe alevapaala gechoo kho nguno nanevo angile vakhamogomba kete omwene amwenee Kilisto.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Apenee Yesu avawelaa, “Ituungo laane lekhale lepikhe. Ila onywenywe namokhowola khopeta ituungo lelensi okhoo. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Vantu va paliwelelo khotopo vawasimbile onywenywe, ila vakhonsimbela onene kho nguno nkhovaweela kete manyile manoji gawe a mabe. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Onywenywe petagi kho wenga owo, onene khotopo mpete, kho nguno ituungo lenaa nkhopogiwa mpete Yelusalemu lekhale lepike.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Panaa aleamalya khopaala egoo, aleendelelaa khosiiga Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apwale kho wenga wa vidindiga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Valunaakwe panaa alevapeta kho wenga, Yesu nanoyo aleapetaa ila khwa khwiswekha. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Valaala va Vayahudi angile vakhomopooga kho wenga owoo, angile vakhowolya, “Mbi muntu oyoo apwale khwenii?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Vantu vinki angile vakhololoma kho madale khomowugela omwene. Vamoonga vawe alevakhopaala, “Muntu oyo atite losongo modugo.” Vaange angile vakhopaala, “Khotopo! Khokhoshaa vantu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ila khotopo yunaa angile khokuwa mbuuto mpola ja Yesu patokhola khwesweekha, kho nguno alevakhovogopa valaala va Vayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ituungo panaa nsiko ja wenga jekhowa japikhaga pakhate, Yesu aleapetaa ingela mo lokinga lwa Nyoomba ya Matuunda no khwandya kholiga. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Apenee Valaala va Vayahudi alevakhumya ne vawaa vakhopaala, “Muntu oyo apatagaa khwenii omanyi mokolo kete ogo, ninga akhale iligage kwekwensi?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu avawelaa, “Malaangi ganaa nkhovaliga nkha gaane, ila gakhopuma khwa Matuunda yunaa aleantomaa. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Muntu mbe khopogaa khonoja mpola jenaa Matuunda khopogaa, alamanya kete malaangi gaane gakhopuma khwa Matuunda, ao nkhopaala masiimo gaane nenee. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Muntu yunaa khwipalela mpola jakwe mwenee, khopooga khwikholya mwenee, ila muntu yunaa khwipogela olaala wa oyoo yunaa aleamotoma, amwenee wa khapanga ne akhakhovapepela vantu vaange. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Mbi, Musa aleakhavapela njaanga? Ila movamoonga venyu, khotopo ninga yomwi yunaa angile alondaa njaanga. Kho kee mokhopooga khombolaga?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Epoo idale la vantu alelamoweela, “Ogwegwe otite mademi. Ananuu yunaa khopogaa khokhowolaga?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu avawelaa, “Alenanojaa ituntumu lemwi Nsiko ya Khosuupa, nanyu vensi alemwakhumya. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa aleavalagelelya movagotole vana venyu, ila nkha kho njaanga ya Musa, ila aleyapumaa kho vakoko venyu, nanyu mokhovagotola vana venyu ninga Nsiko ya Khosuupa. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Mbe onywenywe mokhomogotola mwana Nsiko ya Khosuupa, ili khovaamba njaanga ja Musa, kho kee onywenywe mokhonsimbela onene kho nguno namoponyajaa muntu Nsiko ya Khosuupa? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mokhamotengemeke muntu kete venaa khwigela, ila tengemekhagi khwa kholoonda okhapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbi oyo amwenee Kilisto yunaa aleasagolwa no Matuunda?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Apenee vantu vamoonga va Yelusalemu angile vakhwiwolya, “Mbi, oyo nkha amwenee yunaa valaala angile vakhomopooga vamoolage? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Kunagi seji khopalaa ne vantu pawelo, ninga valaala akhavakhomogilya kento chechensi. Mbi, valaala amba vamanyaga kete oyo amwene Kilisto? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Ila Kilisto panaa aliija khotopo muntu yunaa alamanya khonaa aleapumagaa, ila osweswe khomanyile khonaa apumagaa muntu oyo.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesu panaa angile kholigaa kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda alekhokowaa lolii no khopaala, “Momanyile khwa khapanga khonaa alenapuma, onene alenkhiija kho olaala waane ila Matuunda yunaa antomagaa amwene wa khapanga. Onywenywe mokhamomanya, <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Ila onene mbomanyile kho nguno napumaga khwakwe, nanoyo amwene yunaa aleantomaa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Gechoo vantu alevapooga khomogweela, ila khotopo muntu yunaa aleapeta khomogweela kho nguno ituungo angile lekhale lekhapikha. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Vantu vinki vanaa alevapwale pidale alevamogoomba Yesu, angile vakhopaala, “Mbi, Kilisto panaa alaija, alanoja matuntumu makolo khokela ganaa anogajaa muntu oyo?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masinjala vakhotomwaa khomogweela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafalisayo alevategeela vantu vakhopwepweta mpola ejoo khomopalela Yesu. Apenee valaala va vapumya matambekho alevawatoma masinjala va nyoomba ya Matuunda vamogweele Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu avawelaa, “Amba mpwale nanyu khwi ituungo ikupe, apenee ndatuuwa khanke khwakwe yunaa aleantoma. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Molampoga ila molalekha khombona, khonaa amba mpwale, onywenywee khotopo mopike.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Valaala va Vayahudi vawa vakhwiwolya venee, “Muntu oyo alapeta khwenii khonaa kholiilwa khomowona? Mbi, alapeta kho nse ja khotale khonaa Vayahudi vakhwikhala movamoonga va vantu vanaa akha Vayahudi, no khovaliga vantu vanaa akha Vayahudi? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Mbi, khopogaa khotoweela chanuu panaa khopalaa, molampoga ila molalekha khombona, khonaa amba mpwale, onywenywee khotopo mopike?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lweje ja meje jenaa jekhopumya opanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Nsiko yenaa alevakhomalelya wenga angile nsiko nkolo ya wenga. Yesu aleimelelaa apalaa kho lolii lokolo, “Mbe khole muntu yeyensi atitee nyoota iije khwaane ang'weele meje ga opanga. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khongombaa onene, kete venaa gakhopaala Maandekho ga Matuunda, ‘Lweje ja meje ga opanga jiliitekela khopuma khwa evoo vanaa valangomba.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu alekhopalelaa Moye wa Matuunda yunaa valapokela vantu vanaa vakhomogoomba Yesu. Ituungo eloo Matuunda angile akhale khomotoma Moye wakwe, kho nguno Yesu angile akhale akhapokela olaala khopuma khwa Daada Matuunda.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vantu vakhobegokha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Vantu panaa alevategeela mpola jenaa alekhopalaa Yesu, vamoonga vawe alevapaala, “Khwa khapanga, muntu oyo amwenee molagoli wa Matuunda!” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Vaange alevapaala, “Oyo amwenee Kilisto.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Ila vaange alevawolya, “Mbi, Kilisto khapuma kho nse ya Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Mbi, Maandekho ga Matuunda akha gakhopaala kete Kilisto alapuma kho odogo wa Daudi ne alalelwa Beselehemu khwi Ihala lenaa alekhwikhalaa Daudi?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Gechoo vantu alevabegonkhana kho mpola ja Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Vantu vamoonga alevakhopooga khomogweela ila khotopo yunaa aleamogweela.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Valaala va Vayahudi vakhosiita khomogoomba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Evoo masinjala va Nyoomba ya Matuunda panaa alevatuuwa patokhola Yesu, vapumya matambekho valaala ne Mafalisayo, nanevo alevavawolya, “Kho kee alemokhamogwela no khomoleeta?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Evoo masinjala va Nyoomba ya Matuunda alevavaweela, “Khotopo muntu yunaa khopalaa mpola jenaa jekhokumya kete venaa khopalaa muntu oyo.” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Mafalisayo vavawolya, “Mbi ninga nanyu mwapepelagwa? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Mbi, khole valaala ao Mafalisayo vanaa vamogombaga muntu oyo? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ila vantu vanaa vakhomogoomba muntu oyo, a vantu vanaa vakhamanya njaanga ja Musa, Matuunda khovaligita vantu kete ewa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Yomwi wa Mafalisayo angile apwale epoo yunaa khwetwaa Nikodemo, oyoo yunaa aleamopetela Yesu otikho, nanoyo avawolya vayakwe, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Mbi, njaanga jisu jekhotopooga khomotengemekha muntu patokhola khomotegelelya taali no khomanya ganaa anogajaa?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Valaala va Vayahudi vamoweela, “Khapanga ninga nagwe wapumelaga Galilaya, kunelelya Maandekho ga Matuunda, olawona kete khotopo mokuuni yunaa khotembolwaa khopuma kho nse ya Galilaya.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />“Apenee kela muntu aleawookhaa no khopeta khokhayaakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mokhiima yunaa aleagwelwaa khonojaa osencha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Ila Yesu aleapetaa kho ketonda cha Mizeituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Igolo lakwe melaawo Yesu aleatuuwa khanke kho Nyoomba ya Matuunda. Vantu vinki alevamopetela, nanoyo aleikhala palomwi nanevo andyaa khovaliga. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Apenee, valaangi va njaanga ja Musa palomwi ne Mafalisayo alevamoletela mokhiima yomwi yunaa aleagwelwaa khonojaa osencha. Vamoleeta no khomwimelekha paolongolo ya vantu vensi. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Apenee vamowela Yesu, “Molaangi, mokhiima oyo amwenee yunaa agwelagwaa khonojaa osencha. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Kho njaanga, Musa aleatopogaa khomokowa mabwe mokhiima kete wa geeke mpakha achee. Mbi, ogwegwee khowona mbi?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Vantu evoo alevamowolya gechoo ili vamogeme Yesu ili vapate njela ya khomositachaa. Ila Yesu aleasunamaa panse no khwandyaa khwandekha paolongo kho lojala lwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Panaa alevendelela khomowolya, Yesu aleimelelaa no khovaweela, “Muntu yeyensi movamoonga venyu yunaa akhale anojage mabe awee wa mwandyo khomojutela ibwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Apenee Yesu aleasunama khanke, no khwandya khwandekha paolongo. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Vantu evoo panaa alevategela gechoo, alevandyaa khowookha muntu yomwii, vakhombi alevalongola khowookha. Yesu aleasigaa aleemwi okho mokhiima oyoo imelelagaa paolongolo wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu aleimelelaa no khomowolyaa mokhiima oyoo, “Valekwenii vanaa angile vakhosikhajaa? Mbi, khotopo muntu yunaa aleakhotengemekha?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Mokhiima oyoo amowelaa, “Meyaa, khotopo ninga yomwii!” Apenee Yesu amowelaa, “Ninga nene nkhakhokhotengemekha. Seji petegaa, ne khwandelelya seji okhanoje khanke mabe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwenee welo wa vantu va paliwelelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu panaa aleapalaa nanevo khanke, aleavawelaa, “Onene amwenee welo wa vantu va paliwelelo. Muntu yeyensi yunaa khongombaa no khontegelelya, khotopo ikhale kho kiiti nsiko jensi, ila alaawa atite welo wa opanga wa nsiko jensi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Apenee Mafalisayo vamoweela, “Ogwegwee khwipalela patokhola muntu yoonge kholageela ganaa khopaala, gechoo ganaa khwipalela ogwegwee nkha ga khapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu avawelaa, “Ninga mbe nkhwipalela ganaa manyile onene, ila mpola jaane a ga khapanga, kho nguno onene manyile khonaa alenapuma no khonaa mpetile. Ila onywenywe mokhamanya khonaa napumaga ninga khonaa mpetile. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Onywenywe mokhontengemekha kete venaa vantu vakhovatengemekha vaange. Ila onene nkhakhomotemengekha muntu yeyensi. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ninga mbe ntengemeke, matengemekho gaane a ga khapanga, kho nguno nkhankhotengemekha ndeemwi, ila onene no Daada yunaa aleantomaa khokhotengemekha palomwi. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Yandekhwagwa kho njaanga jenyu kete owoni wa vantu vawele awenee wa khapanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Vawoni vawele a nenee no Daada yunaa aleantomaa, kho gechoo owoni wisu a wakhapanga.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Apenee vamowolya, “Iso apwale khwenii?” Yesu avawelaa, “Onyweywe mokhammanya onene ninga Daada yaane mokhamomanya. Mbe anga mommanye onene, no Daada yaane nanoyo anga amomomanya.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu aleapalaa mpola ejoo panaa alekholiga kho chumba cha Nyoomba ya Matuunda khonaa mpia ne nsawo alejekhotolwa. Ila khotopo muntu yunaa aleamogwelaa, kho nguno ituungo lakwe angile lekhale khopikha.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Onene khonaa mpetile onywenywee khotopo mopete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu aleavawelaa khanke, “Onene nkhowookha onywenywe molampoga, ila molaafwa kho mabe genyu. Onene khonaa mpetile, onywenywee khotopo mwiije.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Apenee valaala va Vayahudi vandyaa khwiwolyaa venee, “Apalagaa khonaa apetile osweswe khotopo khopete. Mbi apetile khwiwolaga?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu avawelaa, “Onywenywee mwapumaga apapanye paliwelelo, onene napumaga pachanya. Onywenywee mole vantu va paliwelelo ele, ila onenee nkha wa paliwelelo ele. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Avyenee alenavaweela molaafwa kho mabe genyu. Mbe molalekha khogoomba kete, ‘Onene Amwenee’, molaafwa kho mabe genyu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Nanevo vamowolyaa, “Ogwegwee ananuu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesu avawelaa, “Onene amwenee kete venaa alenavaweela khopuma mwandyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ntite minki gakhopaala ne gakhovatengemekha onywenywee. Ila oyoo yunaa aleantomaa awa khapanga. Nane nkhovaweela mpola jenaa alenajitegeela kwakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Ninga alevakhatembola kete Yesu khougela mpola ja Ise. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Apenee avawelaa, “Panaa molamonyanyola pamosalaba Mwana wa Muntu, epoo apenee molamanya kete, ‘Onene Amwenee,’ ne nkhakhonojaa chechensi kete venaa nkhopooga, ila nkhonoja kete venaa Daada aleandigaa. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Oyoo yunaa aleantomaa apwale palomwii nane, akhandekha ndeemwi kho nguno nsiko jensi nkhonojaa egoo ganaa atogilwee.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Yesu panaa alekhopalaa mpola ejoo, vantu vinki alevamogoomba.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khapanga khevapelaa vantu wilegesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Apenee Yesu aleavawela Vayahudi vanaa alevamogoomba, “Mbe molagalonda malaangi gaane, molaawa vahemba vaane va khapanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Apenee molamanya khapanga, naneyo ilavanoja mowee no wilegesi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Nanevo vamoweela, “Osweswee khole valelwa va Abulaamu, osweswe khokhale khowee vasi wa muntu yeyensi. Otite maana kee panaa khopaala, ‘Molaawa no wilegesi’?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu avawelaa, “Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, muntu yeyensi yunaa khonojaa mabe, a mwasi wa mabe. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mwasi akhakhwikhalaa nsiko jensi khokhaye khwa molaala wakwe, ila Mwana khwikhalaa khokayawe nsiko jensi. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Gechoo, mbe Mwana alavapela wilegesi, amba mwapataga wilegesi wa khapanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Manyile kete onywenywee mole valelwa va Abulaamu. Ila mokhopooga khombolaga kho nguno mokhosiita khopokeela malaangi gaane. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Nkhovaweela egoo ganaa alenawonaga panaa alempwale no Daada yaane, ila onywenywee mokhonojaa egoo ganaa isenyu alavawelaa monoje.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Evenee vamowela, “Abulahamu amwene Daada yisu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu avawelaa, “Anga mowee mole vana va Abulaamu, anga amonoja ganaa aleanojaa Abulaamu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Onene alenavawelaga mpola ya khapanga yenaa alenategeela khopuma khwa Matuunda, ninga gechoo, onywenywee mokhopooga khombolaga. Abulaamu aleakhanoja gechoo. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Onywenywee mokhonojaa mpola jenaa Daada yenyu khonoja.” Evenee vamoweela, “Osweswee nkha vana va nsalalyo, Matuunda aleemwi amwenee Daada yisu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu avawelaa, “Kete Matuunda anga awe Daada yenyu, anga amontogwa onene, kho nguno onene napumile khwa Matuunda ne seji mpwaale epa, alenkhiija khwa kholoma onene mweene ila a Matuunda aleantoma. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Kho kee mokhamanya ganaa nkhopaala? Kho nguno mokhaloma khotegelelya malaangi gaane. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Onywenywee mole vana va Khatawe yunaa isenyu, nanyu mokhopooga khonojaa ganaa khopogaa monojee. Omwenee amwenee angile mowolagi khopuma pa mwandyo wa owoombi, ne akhakhwimelela khapanga, kho nguno khotopo khapanga mokhate yakwe. Panaa khopalaa opepi, khopalaa echoo kenaa aleiyandelelaa mwenee, kho nguno omwenee a mopepi no a daada wa opepi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ila onene nkhovaweela okhapanga, onywenywee akhamokhongoomba. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Mbi, ananuu yomwii pakhate yenyu yunaa nopumya owoni kete onenee ntite mabe? Mbe nkhovaweela khapanga, kho kee onywenywee mokhamokhongoomba? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa a wa Matuunda khotegelelya ganaa Matuunda khopalaa. Ila onywenywee nkhamokhotegelelya kho nguno onywenywe mokhamokhopuma kwa Matuunda.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a molaala khokela Abulaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Vayahudi vamowolya, “Mbi, alekhokhapala khapanga ogwegwee a Mosamalia, ne otite idemi?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu avawelaa, “Onene ntokhola idemi. Onene nkhomopeela Daada loojo yaane, ila onywenywee mokhombyeeda. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Onene nkhankhwipogela olaala waane nenee, ila apwale yoonge yunaa khompogela olaala owoo, nanoyo amwenee khotengemekha patokhola khobegola muntu. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, yeyensi yunaa khotegelelya malaangi gaane khotopo afwee nsiko jensi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Apenee Vayahudi vamoweela, “Seji khwatembolaga kete ogwegwee otite idemi, Abulaamu ne vakuuni va Matuunda vensi angile vafwaa, ila ogwegwee khopaala, ‘Yeyensi yunaa khotegelelya malaangi gaane khotopo afwee nsiko jensi.’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Mbi, ogwegwee khwinojaa ole molaala khokela daada yisu Abulaamu yunaa aleafwaa? Ninga vakuuni va Matuunda alevafwaa. Gechoo khopaala ogwegwee ananuu?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu avawelaa, “Mbe ndipela loojo nenee, olaala waane amba nkha kento. Daada yaane amwenee khompelaa loojo onene, oyoo yunaa onywenywee mokhopaala a isenyu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Onywenywee mokhamomanya, ila onenee mbomanyile. Ne mbe ampala nkhamomanya, amba nde mopepi kete onywenywee. Ila onene mbomanyile, ne Mpola yakwe nkhoetegelelya. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Isenyu Abulaamu, aleasekelelaa modugo panaa aleawonaa nsiko ya khwija khwaane. Ne panaa aleayewonaa, aleasekelelaa modugo.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Apenee Vayahudi vamoweela, “Ogwegwee okhale opichee ninga myakha makomi gataano, nagwe wamowonaga mbi Abulaamu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu avawelaa, “Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, panaa Abulahamu aleakhale alelwee, onenee angile mpwale.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Vayahudi panaa alevategeela egoo, alevasolangela mabwee ili vamojutele, Ila Yesu aleiswekhaa, anyelemokha no khopumaa mo Nyoomba ya Matuunda.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopony'a muntu yunaa angile alelilwe mtulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu panaa angile khokelaa, aleamowona muntu yomwii, yunaa angile mtulu mpuma kholelwa khwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Vahemba vakwe alevamowolya, “Molaangi! Ananuu yunaa anojagaa mabe, ninga muntu oyo alelwaa mtulu, a muntu oyo ao valeli vakwe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu avawelaa, “Nkha muntu oyo, ninga valeli vakwe vanaa alevanojaa mabe. Ila alealelwaa mtulu ili olaala wa Matuunda wigele kho wome wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Khokhopogiwa khonoja molemo gwa oyoo yunaa aleantoma panaa khokhale lyonse, otikho panaa okhwingela khotopo muntu yeyensi yunaa alakhowola khonojaa melemo. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Ituungo panaa nkhale mpwale paliwelelo, onene nde welo wa vantu va paliwelelo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Panaa aleamalya khopaala gechoo, aleatyaa matye panse, aleakhadanga maloongo, apenee amopakhaa mtulu oyoo momiso, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />no khomoweela, “Yagaa okhalawe khwi iwoga la Siloamu, emaana yakwe yunaa aleatomwa.” Epoo apenee mtulu oyoo aleapetaa khokhalawa miso gakwe ne atuuwa khowonaa.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Vantu vanaa alevakhwikhala pepi nanoyo ne evoo vanaa alevamowonaga kholoomba loomba, viwolyaa, “Mbi, oyo nkha amwenee oyoo yunaa angile khikhalaga epa no kholoomba loomba?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Vamoonga vawe alevapaala, “Oyo amwenee.” Vaange alevapalaa, “Nkha amwenee! Ipyanilee nanoyo topo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Ila vaange alevapaala oyo amwenee yunaa alekholomba lomba, “Onenee amwenee!”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Kho gechoo, angile vakhomowolyaa, “Mbi, miso gakhoo alegadigokha mbi ninga wakhowola khowona?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Avawelaa, “Muntu oyoo yunaa alekhwetwaa Yesu aleakhadanga maloongo, ampakhaa kho miso gaane no khombweela, ‘Mpete Siloamu khokhawala.’ Gechoo alenapeta khokhalawa no khwandya khowona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Vamowolya, “Alekwenii muntu oyoo?” Nanoyo avawelaa, “Onene nkhamanya khonaa apwalee!”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo vakholondelelya venaa muntu oyoo aleaponywaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Apenee alevamokenkha muntu oyoo yunaa angile mtulu khwa Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Nsiko eyoo yenaa Yesu aleakhadanga maloongo no khomopakha mtulu oyoo momiso, ne miso gakwe gadigokha, angile Nsiko ya Khosuupa. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Apenee Mafalisayo alevamowolya khanke muntu oyoo, “Wakhowola mbi khowona?” Nanoyo avawelaa, “Angile ampakhaa maloongo momiso gaane, no khombweela nkhalawe, apenee nandyaa khowona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mafalisayo vamoonga alevapaala, “Muntu oyo akhakhopumaa khwa Matuunda, kho nguno akhakholondaa njaanga ya Nsiko ya Khosuupa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Ila vaange alevapaala, “Mbi muntu yunaa atite mabe nokhowolaa mbi khonojaa matuntumu kete ega?” Apenee alevandyaa khwibegola venee kho venee.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Alevamowolya khanke muntu oyoo yunaa angile mtulu, “Kho nguno muntu oyoo akhodigolaga miso, okhomopalela mbi muntu oyoo?” Nanoyo avawelaa, “A mokuuni wa Matuunda.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Valaala va Vayahudi alevakhagomba kete muntu oyoo angile mtulu, ne seji khowonaa. Gechoo alevaveeta valeli va muntu oyoo. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Vavawolya valeli vakwe, “Mbi, oyo amwenee mwanenyu yunaa mokhopaala alealelwa mtulu? Mbi akhowolaa mbi khowona seji?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Valeli vakwe vavaweela, “Khomanyile kete oyo amwenee mwaniisu, ne angile alelwaa mtulu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ila khokhamanya venaa akhowola khowona. Ninga muntu yunaa aleamodigola miso gakwe khokhamomanya. Mowolaji mwenee, kho nguno muntu oyo a mokolo nokhowolaa khwipalela mwenee.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Valeli vakwe alevapaala gechoo kho nguno alevakhovogopa valaala va Vayahudi, kho nguno valaala evoo alevigombajaa kete, mbe muntu yeyensi yunaa alamogomba Yesu amwenee Masiya, khanke yunaa khwetwaa Kilisto, aladagwa kho nyoomba ya khwitangela Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Avyenee valeli vakwe alevapaala, “Oyo a muntu mokolo, mowolaji mwenee.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Apenee, alevamweta khanke oyoo yunaa angile mtulu, vamoweela, “Mopele Matuunda olaala. Osweswee khomanyile kete muntu yunaa aleakhodigolaga miso gakhoo muntu oyoo atitee mabe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Muntu oyoo avawelaa, “Onene nkhamanya kete muntu oyoo atitee mabe ao atokhola mabe. Kento kemwii kenaa manyile, angile nde mtulu ne seji nkhowona.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Apenee vamowolya muntu oyoo, “Mbi akhonojelaa chanuu? Aleakhodigola mbi miso gakhoo?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Muntu oyoo avawelaa, “Navawelaga ila alemokhantegelelya. Kho kee mokhopooga mbawele khanke? Mbi, nanyu mokhopooga mowee mole vahemba vakwe?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Alevamotokha no khomoweela, “Ogwegwee ole mohemba wa muntu oyo, ila osweswee khole vahemba va Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Osweswee khomanyile kete Matuunda aleapalaa no Musa, ila muntu oyo khokhamanya khonaa apumagaa!” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Muntu oyo avawelaa, “Mpola eyoo ya khokumyaa! Mokhamanya khonaa apumaga, ila muntu oyo andigolaga miso gaane. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Khomanyile kete Matuunda akhakhovategelelya vantu vanaa vatite mabe, ila khovategelelya vantu evoo vanaa vakhomkumbekha no khoganoja ganaa khopogaa. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Khopuma khowombwa khwa liwelelo khokhale khotegeele kete muntu yeyensi agadigolaga miso ga muntu yunaa angile alelagwa mtulu. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Mbe muntu oyo aleakhapuma khwa Matuunda, anga khotopo anojee chechensi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Valaala va Vayahudi vamoweela, “Ogwegwee angile walelwaa no khokolela kho mabe, mbi nokhowola mbi khogema khotoliga osweswee?” Apenee, alevamodaga apume panji.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otulu wa momooyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu panaa aleategelaa kete muntu oyoo adagagwaa omoo. Panaa alevitaanga nanoyo aleamowolya, “Mbi, ogwegwee khomogoomba Mwana wa Muntu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Muntu oyoo aleapalaa, “Meyaa, muntu oyoo a ananuu? Mbwelee ili nane mbomogombe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu amowelaa, “Ogwegwe taali wamowonaga, oyoo amwene yunaa khopalaa nagwe seji.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Apenee, oyoo muntu apalaa, “Mwene nkhogoomba.” Epoo apenee aleatungumaa no khomokumbekha Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu aleapalaa, “Onene nijaga paliwelelo ili khovatengemekha vantu, ili vanaa vatulu vandyee khowona, ne vanaa nkha vakhowona vawee vatulu.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mafalisayo vamoonga vanaa angile vapwale pepi no Yesu alevategeela venaa angile khopalaa, vamoweela, “Mbi, ninga nasu khole vatulu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu avawelaa, “Mbe anga mowee vatulu, anga amba motokhola mabe, ila kho nguno mokhopaala mokhowona, mokhawochelwa mabe genyu no Matuundaa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Mosoongi mosoga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu avawelaa, “Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, yeyensi yunaa akhakhwingela mwi iwegele la nkholo khwa khokelela pamolyango, ila khotomela njela yeenge khwa khotaanta logelele, oyoo alaawa mwiwi no mosuki. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Ila yunaa khwingela khokelela kho molyango, oyoo amwenee mosoongi. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Molendeleli khomodigolela mosoongi, ne nkholo jekhotegeela lolii lwakwe, nanoyo khojetaa nkholo jakwe kela yemwii kho lina lakwe, no khojepumya panji. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Mosoongi panaa khowaa ajepumaja nkholo jakwe jensi panji, khojilongola paolongolo, apenee nkholo nanejo jekhomoloonda, kho nguno vamanyile lolii lwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Nkholo ejoo khotopo jemolonde mohenja, ila valamokembela kho nguno vakhajimanya melolii ja vahenja.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu aleavawelaa mofwano ogoo, ila evenee alevakhamanya emaana yenaa alekhovawelaa.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwenee mosoongi mosoga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Apenee Yesu avawelaa khanke, “Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, onene amwenee molyango gwa nkholo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Vantu vensi vanaa alevalongola angile viwi ne vasuki, ne nkholo alejekhavategelelya. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Onene amwenee molyango. Ne yeyensi yunaa khwingelaa khokelela khwaane amwenee alaponywa. Vakhopumano khopata endya yenaa khopogaa. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mwiwi khwiijaa ili khwiwa ne khovawolaga no khonoona. Ila onene niijaga ili onywenywee mowee no opanga, khanke mowe nanewo khwa winki.”<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Onene nde mosoongi mosoga. Mosoongi mosoga khowopwelyaa opanga wakwe, ili nkholo jakwe jekhawolagwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Motomami nkha mosoongi, yunaa nkholo nkha jakwe khojelekha nkholo ne menga jiijile jekhogweela nkholo no khojesambalya. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Omwene akha kholomela momooyo wakwe kho nguno ya nkholo kho nguno omwene a muntu yunaa khokunelelya malepo topo. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Onene nde mosoongi mosoga wa vantu. Mbamanyile vantu vaane visoga, nanevo vamanyile visoga, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />kete venaa Daada yaane ammanyile onenee, nane avyenee mbomanyile Daada. Onenee nkhopumya opanga khovapony'a vantu vaane. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Onene ntite nkholo jiinge jenaa nkha ja iwegele ele, nanevo avivyoo khempoga mbalete kho iwegele ele. Nanevo valategeela lolii lwaane, gechoo palaawa ne idale lemwii no mosoongi yomwii.”<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Daada khontogwaa kho nguno nkhopumya opanga waane ili nkhowole khoosola khanke. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Khotopo muntu yunaa nonsukhaa opanga waane, ila onene nkhopumya opanga waane khwa khotogwa nenee. Ntite olaala khoopumyaa opanga waane ne khoosola opanga waane khanke. Geeke avyenee Daada yaane aleambwela nojee.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Kho nguno ya mpola ejoo Vayahudi alevandyaa khwikilya. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Vinki vawe angile vakhopaala, “Ingelagwaa ne idemi, gechoo awagaa asalinkhanaga, Kho kee khomotegelelye?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Vaange angile vakhopaala, “Eje nkha mpola ja muntu yunaa atite idemi. Mbi, idemi nokhowolaa khomodigola mtulu?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khositelwaa ne Vayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Wenga wa khokombola khotoola Nyoomba ya Matuunda ewee njelo paolongolo wakwe, aleyanojekha Yelusalemu, ne ituungo eloo angile la mpepo. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Nanoyo Yesu angile khogendaa mo Nyoomba ya Matuunda kho mavanza ga Solomoni. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Vayahudi alevamopilima no khomowolyaa, “Olatutungumekha mpakha nale? Mbe ogwegwee amwenee Kilisto, yunaa ijile khotopon'ya, khokholoomba otowele patokhola khotosweekha.”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu avawelaa, “Navawelile, ila alemokhagomba. Milemo jenaa nkhojenojaa onene kho olaala wa Daada yaane jekholageela kete onene ananuu. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Ila onywenywee mokhamokhongoomba kho nguno onywenywee nkha nkholo jaane. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Nkholo jaane jekhotegeela lolii lwaane, nane mbamanyile, nanevo vakhondoonda. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Onenee nkhovapeela opanga nsiko jensi, nanevo khotopo vawolagwe ninga nsiko yemwii. Khotopo muntu yunaa nokhowola khonsukha. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Daada yaane amwenee yunaa aleampelaa nkholo ejoo, nanoyo amwenee molaala khokela vensi, khotopo muntu yunaa alakhowola khovasukha khopuma khwa Daada yaane. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Onene no Daada khole kete muntu yomwii.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Vayahudi alevasolangela mabwee khanke ili vamokhowee. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu avawelaa, “Navalageela melemo minki khopuma khwa Daada. Mbi molemo gonaa alenagojaa ninga mokhopooga monkhowe ne mabwee?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Vayahudi vamoweela, “Akhatokhokhokowa ne mabwee kho nguno wanogajaa mpola nsoga, ila tokhokhokowa ne mabwee kho nguno okhomotokha Matuunda, kho nguno ogwegwee ole muntu topo, ila khwinojaa ole Matuunda.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu avawelaa, “Mbi, angile ekhandekhwa kho njaanga jenyu kete, ‘Matuunda aleapalaa, onywenywee a meloongo?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Matuunda aleavetaa meloongo vantu evoo vanaa alevapelwaa okhombe wakwe, nasu khomanyile kete Maandekho ga Matuunda gakhopaala mpola ja khapanga nsiko jensi. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Mbi, mokhokhowola mbi khopaala oyoo yunaa aleatomwa no Daada khomotokha Matuunda, kho nguno alenapaala onene nde Mwana wa Matuunda? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Mbe nkhankhonojaa milemo ja Daada yaane, mokhangombe. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ila mbe nkhojenojaa milemo ja Daada yaane, ninga mbe mokhamokhongoomba, jigombagi milemo ejoo, ili momanye ne khotemboola kete Daada apwale mokhate yaane, nane nde mokhate yakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Apenene alevapooga khanke khomogweela, ila aleanyelemokhaa momekhono jawe apetaa.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Apenee Yesu aleapetaa khanke kho nkelo ya lweje Yolodani, lwande yenaa Yohana angile khobatija epoo pamyakha, nanoyo ikhala okhoo. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Vantu vinki alevamopetela Yesu nanevo alevakhomowolya, “Yohana aleakhanoja ituntumu lelensi, ila kela kento kenaa Yohana aleapalaa khowugela muntu oyo a chakhapanga.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Vantu vinki vanaa angile vapwale okhoo, alevamogoomba Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Khocha kwa Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Aleapwale muntu yomwii lina lakwe Lazalo, nanoyo angile molwile. Omwenee angile khwikhalaa Betania khonaa alevakhwikhala Malia no Malita vilombolakwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Malia oyo amwenee yunaa aleamwetela Mwene makhuta gakhotukelela mo megolo no khomopogosa nyele jakwe, seji mokolwawe Lazalo angile molwile. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Gechoo viloombo vakwe alevatoma okhombe khwa Yesu khomoweela, “Mwene, molaasi wakhoo yunaa omotogwile a molwile.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu panaa aleapata okhombe owoo, apalaa, “Olwile khotopo omowolage, ila olalageela venaa Matuunda a molaala. Ili Mwana wa Matuunda akholiwe khokelela owoo olwile.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Ninga venaa Yesu angile khovatogwa Malita no Malia palomwi no Lazalo, <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />panaa aleategela kete Lazalo a molwile, aleikhala akhokhonye no khokelelya nsiko jewele. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Apenee Yesu avawelaa vahemba vakwe, “Khotuuwe Yudea.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Vahemba vakwe vamowela, “Molaangi, ituungo ikupe topo lakelaga Vayahudi alevakhopooga khokhowolaga ne mabwe, kho kee khopooga khotuuwa khanke okhoo?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu avawelaa, “Mbi lyonse letokhola matuungo ikomi ne gawele? Muntu mbe ageende lyonse khotopo ikumpe kho nguno gopwale welo wa paliwelelo. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ila yeyensi yunaa khogendaa otikho alaikumpa kho nguno welo otapoya mokhate yawe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khopaala egoo, aleapala, “Molaasi wisu Lazalo seji agonagaa, ila onenee ndapeta khomolawelya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Vahemba vakwe vamoweela, “Mwene, mbe agonagaa ndoolo, alapona.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yesu angile khopalela ncha ya Lazalo, ila evenee alevakhosiima khogona ndoolo.<verse eid="JHN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Apenee, Yesu aleavawela patokhola khovaswekha, “Lazalo afwagaa. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Ila onene nkhotogwaa kho nguno alentapoya panaa Lazalo alekhochaa, ili onywenywe mokhowole khogoomba. Gechoo khopetage khokhayaakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi yunaa alekhwetwaa Ipasa avawelaa vahemba vayakwe, “Nasu khopetage khofwapalomwi no Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwenee ofufolo no opanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu panaa alepikha okhoo ihala la Betania, aleamopikhaa Lazalo aleatulagwaa mwi khabuli kho nsiko jenee. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Ihala la Betania angile lepwale pepi ne Yelusalemu, otale wa kilomita jetato. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Vayahudi vinki angile vijaga Betania khovalamocha Malita no Malia kho nguno ya ncha ya mokolwawe Lazalo.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Malita panaa aleategelaa Yesu iijile, apetaa khomowawola, ila Malia aleasigaa khokhaye. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Malita amowelaa Yesu, “Mwene, mbe anga owee opwale epa, mokolwaane, anga khotopo afwee. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ila manyile ninga seji mbe oloombe chechensi khwa Matuunda, khakhopela.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu amowelaa, “Mokolwakhoo khafufokha.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Malita amowelaa, “Manyile kete alafufokha ituungo la khofufolwaa vachi isiko la odugo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu amowelaa, “Onene amwenee ofufolo no opanga. Muntu yunaa khongoomba onenee ninga mbe alafwa alaawa no opanga, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />muntu yeyensi yunaa mopanga no khongoomba onene, khwa khapanga khotopo achee. Mbi, khogagoomba ega?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Malita amowelaa, “Avyenee Mwene, onene nagombaga kete ogwegwe amwenee Kilisto, Mwana wa Matuunda, yunaa Matuunda aleatolapela kete alamotoma.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomokotelaa Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Malita Panaa aleamalya khopaala egoo, ingelaa mokhate no khomweta Malia pampelo, amowelaa aleemwi, “Molaangi apwale epa, khokweta.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Malia panaa aleategelaa gechoo, angile anyanyokha waango, amolondaa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Ituungo eloo, Yesu angile akhale khopikha pihala la Betania, ila angile apwale apaponye panaa alevitaanga no Malita. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Vayahudi vanaa angile vapwale pakhaye epoo khomolamochaa Malia, panaa alevamowona Malia anyanyokha waango khopuma panji alevamoloonda, alevakhosiima ailee khokotela kho khabuli.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Malia panaa aleapikhaa lwande yenaa aleapwale Yesu, aleatungamaa no khomoweela, “Mwene, mbe anga owee opwale epa, mokolwaane, angakhotopo afwee.”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu panaa aleamowonaa, Malia khokotaa palomwi ne Vayahudi vanaa aleviija palomwi nanoyo, aleasayaa no mooyo gwakwe gwasaata. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Yesu avawolyaa, “Mbi mwamozyekhaga kwenii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Vamoweela, “Mwene, ijo okuune.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu akotaa.<verse eid="JHN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Apenee Vayahudi vapaala, “Kunagi venaa aleamotogwile Lazalo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ila vantu vaange vapaala, “Muntu oyo amwene yunaa aleamodigola mtulu oyoo, kho kee aleakhakhowola khomonojaa Lazalo akhafwe?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomofufola Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu panaa angile akhale khosayaa no khwitegeela viba momooyo gwakwe, apetaa kho khabuli. Ikhabuli eloo angile ipinga lenaa angile legubikwe ne ibwe pamolyango. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu avaweela, “Lewochagi ibwee eloo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Malita yunaa angile ilombolakwe no Lazalo aleapalaa, “Mwene, seji khotukhaa, kho nguno atite nsiko jenee mpuma panaa aleazyekhwa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu amowelaa “Mbi, alenkhakowela kete mbe olagomba olawona olaala wa Matuunda?”<verse eid="JHN 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Gechoo alevalewochaa ibwee elo. Apenee Yesu aleakunaa khochanya khwa Matuunda no khopaala, “Nkokosongela Daada yaane kho nguno ogwegwee khontegelelya. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Manyile kete khontegelelaja nsiko jensi, ila nkhopaala geeke kho nguno ya vantu vanaa vimelelaga epa, ila nkopooga vandye khogoomba kete ogwegwe amwenee yunaa alewantomaga.”<verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khopaala egoo, aleapalaa kho lolii lokolo, “Lazalo, wiije okhono panji.” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Lazalo yunaa aleafwagaa aleapuma panji ya ikhabuli, okho mekhono ne megolo jakwe jitungilwe shanda. Osho wakwe alewapilingagwaa ketambala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:44">Yesu avawelaa, “Motungulagi no momoleke apete.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayahudi vakhopooga khomowolaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Maluko 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luka 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Vayahudi vinki vanaa angile vapwale palomwi no Malia, panaa alevawona mpola je Yesu aleanogaja, alevamogoomba. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ila Vayahudi vaange alevapeta khwa Mafalisayo khovaweela ganaa aleaganogaja Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Gechoo valaala va vapumya matambekho ne Mafalisayo aleviitanga iluungo la ivanza ikolo la Vayahudi, viwolya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:47">“Seji khonojee kee? Muntu khonoja lomekho nyinki. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Mbe khomoleke endelele khonojaa lomekho eje, vantu vensi valamogoomba, apenee valaala va Loma valiija khononanga Nyoomba ya Matuunda ne nse yisu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Ila yomwi wa valaala vawe yunaa angile khwetwaa Kayafa, yunaa angile mopumya matambekho molaala wa Matuunda kho mwakha ogoo, avawelaa, “Onywenywe mokhamanya kento chechensi! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Mbi mokhamanya kete amba visoga mbe muntu yomwi afwee kho nguno ya vantu vinki, khokela nse yensi inonwee?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Kayafa aleakhapala gechoo kho masiimo gakwe mwenee. Ila kho nguno angile mopumya matambekho molaala kho mwakha ogoo, aleamanyile kete Yesu alafwaa kho nguno ya nse yakwe, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />ila nkha kho nguno ya nse eye topo, ila kho nguno ya khovakhongan'ya vana va Matuunda vanaa vasambalaga okho no okhoo, ili khovanoja vawe palomwi.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Gechoo, mpuma nsiko eyoo Vayahudi alevendelela khopooga njela ya khomowolaga Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Gechoo, Yesu angile akhagenda khanke pawelo pakhate ya Vayahudi. Aleapuma epoo no khopeta pepi ne pipalangwa, pihala lenaa lekwetwa Efulaimu ikhala okhoo palomwi ne vahemba vakwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Wenga wa Vayahudi wa pasakha angile watelelaga, vantu vinki alevapeta Yelusalemu velopiwee ili vanojwe khogoombwa kho njaanga ja khomokumbekha Matuunda panaa Pasakha aleikhale khopikha. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Evoo vantu vanaa angile vapeta Yelusalemu alevandya khomopooga Yesu. Nanevo panaa aleveema kho lwande yenaa ipwale mokhate ya Nyoomba ya Matuunda, vawaa vakhwiwolya, “Mbi onywenywe mokhowona mbi? Mbi Yesu khotopo iije kho wenga owo?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Valaala va Vapumya matambekho va Matuunda ne Mafalisayo, alevawalagelelya vantu, muntu yeyensi yunaa amanyile khonaa Yesu apwale avawele ili vakhowole khomogweela.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Malia khomopakha Yesu makhuta ga mpia nyinki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maluko 14:3-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Alejasigaga nsiko sita wenga wa pasakha opike, Yesu aleapetaa Betania khokhaye khwa Lazalo oyoo yunaa Yesu aleamofufola. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Okhoo alevamwandalela endya ya mesee, no Malita alekhovatomamelaa. Lazalo angile yomwi wawe wa vanaa alevakholya endya palomwi no Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Malia aleasola nusu lita ya nsopa ya makhuta gakhotokela ga mpia nyinki, ganaa gakhonogelelwa khopuma kho ipeke gonaa gokhwetwaa nado, amwitekelya kho megolo Yesu no khopogusa ne nyele jakwe. Nyoomba yensi angile ketukelela otukeleli mosoga wa makhuta egoo. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Apenee Yuda Isikaliote yomwi wa vahemba va Yesu, yunaa alamogalokha Yesu, awolyaa, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Kho kee khokhagolye makhuta egoo kho mpia nyinki ne mpia ejoo vapelwee vapeena?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Aleapalaa gechoo, nkha kho nguno angile khovasosopaa vapeena, ila angile mwiwi. Yuda amwenee alekhowamba mufukho gwa khotolela mpia ne kela mala angile khwiwa mpia ejoo.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yesu aleapalaa, “Molekhagi mokhiima oyo, akhagagolya makhuta ega, kho nguno ya nsiko yaane ya khozyekhwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Vapeena mole nanevo nsiko jensi, ila onene khotopo nde palomwi nanyu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayahudi vakhopooga khomowolaga Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Vayahudi vinki alevategela kete Yesu angile apwale Betania. Gechoo alevapetaa okhoo nkha khomowona Yesu topo, ila alevapeta no khomowona Lazalo, yunaa aleafufolwa no Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Kho nguno angile Masadukayo, alevakhagomba mpola ja ofufolo, alevakhopooga khomowolaga Lazalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />kho nguno ya khofufolwa khwakwe, Vayahudi vinki alevibegola ne Masadukuyo no khomogoomba Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khwingelaa Yelusalemu khwa ngiligili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Igolo lakwe, idale ikolo la vantu vanaa alevijaga kho wenga wa Pasakha, alevategeela kete Yesu angile ijilee Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Apenee alevasola matambe ga matende, vapeta khomowawola Yesu, no khomopongela ili khomokholya, vajoma kho lolii no khopaala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">“Hosana, emaana yakwe Khomokolye Mwene! Khomokolye yunaa khotonojela masoga yunaa ijile kwisu kho lina la Mwene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">Anojelwe masoga Mwami wa Izilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu panaa aleamopata mwana wa ndogowe, amotantaa kho mogoongo kete venaa Maandekho ga Matuunda venaa gakhopaala.<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Onywenywe vantu va ihala la Yelusalemu mokhatungumale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Kunagii, Mwami wenyu ijile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Amotantagaa mwana ndogowe khwa opanga.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Ituungo eloo vahemba va Yesu alevakhamanya mpolo ejoo taali, ila Yesu panaa aleafufokha no khopelwa olaala, epoo alevakhombola kete egoo gensi alegandekwaga kho Maandekho ga Matuunda khomopalela mwenee, nanevo alevamonojela kete venaa aleyandekhwaga.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Vantu vanaa alevapwale palomwi no Yesu ituungo lenaa Lazalo alekhopuma mwikhabuli, alevendelela khovaweela vantu vaange egoo ganaa alevagawonaga. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Eye ayenee nguno yenaa vantu alevateegela kete Yesu amwenee yunaa aleanogaja ituntumu ele, alevapeta khomowawola. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Apenee Mafalisayo alevakhopalana, “Mowine? Khotopo monojee chechensi, kunagi vantu vensi vakhomolonda.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vamoonga va Vayunani vakhopooga khomowona Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Angile khole ne Vayunani vatiiti movamoonga va vantu vanaa alevapikha Yelusalemu khomkumbekha Matuunda ituungo la wenga wa Pasakha, <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Vayunani evoo alevamopetela Filipo, mwikhali wa Betisaida kho nse ya Galilaya, vamoweela “Meyaa, osweswe khokhopooga khomowone Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipo aleapetaa khomoweela Andelea mpola ejoo, apenee vensi vapeta khomoweela Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu avawelaa, “Ituungo la Mwana wa Muntu khopokeela olaala wapikhaga. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, mbe nsanka ya ngano ikhapuselwa panse no khowola, ilasiga yemwi kete venaa ipwale. Ila mbe yapuselagwa no khowola, ilalela nsanka nyinki. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khotogwa opanga wakwe khaupwelya, ila muntu yunaa khosimbela opanga wakwe kho liwelelo ele, oyoo kholindaa opanga wakwe nsiko jensi. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khontomamela onene khopogiwa andonde, pepensi panaa amba mpwale, apenee no motomami waane alaawa. Daada alamokholya muntu yeyensi yunaa khontomamela onene.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khopalela ncha yakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Seji mooyo gwaane gokhosata, ampala chanuu? Mbi, mpale, ‘Daada, ompon'ye ituungo ele la magayo?’ Khotopo nkhowole kholoomba gechoo kho nguno nijaga khokelela magayo ega. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Daada, lagelaa olaala wakhoo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Epoo lolii alelwategelekha khopuma khochanya khwa Matuunda, “Nalelagelaga olaala waane, ninga gechoo ndalagela khanke.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Vantu vanaa alevimelelaga epoo alevategeela lolii eloo ne vamoonga vawe alevapaalaa a ngilimo ketalamokhaa, ne vaange alevapaala, “Motomami wa pachanya pa Matuunda khopalaa nanoyo.”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Ila Yesu aleavawelaa, “Lolii lonaa mwalotegelaga lokhiija kho nguno yaane, ila yijaga kho nguno yenyu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Seji a ituungo la liwelelo ele khotengemekhwa, gechoo Khatawe, molaala wa liwelelo ele, alepepi khowopwelya olaala wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Ituungo lenaa onene ndanyanyolwa no khopagekwa pamosalaba, ndavakwesa vantu vensi viije khwaane.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yesu alekhovawelaa venaa vantu valamowolaga.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Gechoo, vantu alevamowelaa, “Njaanga yisu kepalaa kete Kilisto alaikhala nsiko jensi. Nokhowola mbi khopaala kete, ‘Mwana wa Muntu alawolagwa pamosalaba?’ Mbi oyoo, ‘Mwana wa Muntu ananuu?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Apenee Yesu avawelaa, “Welo ikhale ipwale nanyu khwi ituungo ikupe topo. Endelalagi khogeenda panaa mokhale motite welo, ili kiiti ikhiije khovakhonya, kho nguno muntu yunaa khogendaa kho kiiti akhamanya khonaa apetile. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Panaa mokhale motite welo owoo, mowogombage, ili mowee mole vana va welo.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Vayahudi vakhosiita khomogoomba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Panaa aleamalya khopaala gechoo Yesu aleawokhaa no khwiswekha ili vantu vakhamowone.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Ninga venaa Yesu aleanogaja matuntumu minki paulongolo wawe, ila evenee alevakhamogomba. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Ega gensi alegapumela ili gadugame egoo ganaa aleapalaa mokuuni wa Matuunda Isaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mwene, ananuu yunaa aleagombaa okhombe wisu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Ananuu yunaa Mwene amolagelaga ngulu jakwe?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Kho gechoo alevakhakhowola khogoomba, avyenee nanoyo mukuuni Matuunda Isaya aleapalaa.<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Matuunda agatululagaa miso gawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">agatungagaa masala gawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ili vakiije vawone kho miso gawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ninga vakiije khomanya khwa masala gawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">ne vakiije khopaala mabe gawe no khogalekha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">nanoyo Matuunda avapon'ya.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Mukuuni wa Matuunda Isaya aleapala mpola eye epoo pamyakha, kho nguno aleawona venaa Mwene angile molaala no khwandekhaa mpola jakwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Ninga gechoo valaala vinki va Vayahudi alevamogoomba Yesu. Ila kho nguno ya Mafalisayo, alevakhakhola khopaala pawelo, kho nguno ya wowa kete valadagwa khopuma kho nyoomba ya khwitangela Vayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Valaala evoo alevakhotogwa khopelwaa loojo ne vantu khokela khopelwaa loojo no Matuunda.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpola ja Yesu jelavatengemekha vantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesu aleajoma lolii no khopaala, “Muntu yeyensi yunaa khongoomba, akhakhongoomba nenee topo, ila khomogomba no Matuunda yunaa aleantoma. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Muntu yunaa khombona onene, khomowona no Matuunda yunaa aleantoma. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Onene nijaga kho vantu va paliwelelo ili mbe nde welo wawe wa khapanga, ili vensi vanaa vakhongoomba vakhasige kho kiiti. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Onene nkhakhomotengekha muntu yeyensi yunaa khotegeela malaangi gaane ila akhakhogaloonda. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Muntu yeyensi yunaa khonsitaa onene palomwi ne malaangi jaane, apwale yunaa alavatengemekha. Malaangi ganaa napalaga agenee galavatengemekha vantu nsiko ya odugo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Onene nkhapala mpola eje kho olaala waane, ila Daada yunaa aleantoma amwenee ambwelaga mpola ja khopaala ne venaa ndapalaa. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Nane manyile mpola jenaa andagelelaja mpaale, agenee galavanoja vantu vikhale nsiko jensi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khovasingaa megolo vahemba vakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Panaa nsiko ya wenga wa Pasakha wa Vayahudi angile ikhale khopikha. Yesu aleamanya ituungo la khowookha paliwelelo angile lapikhaga. Nanoyo alekhovatogwaa vanaa alevakhomogoomba, ne aleavatogwa khwa khapanga.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Ituungo lenaa Yesu ne vahemba vakwe angile vakholya endya ya mesee. Khatawe angile taali amwingelaga Yuda, mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti, no khomopeela isiimo la khomogalokha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu angile amanyile kete Daada yakwe amopelaga vento vyensi. Avivyoo aleamanyile kete apumaga khwa Matuunda ne atuwile khanke khwa Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Gechoo aleimelela epoo panaa alevakholya, alyola mwenda gwakwe gwa pachanya, atulaa pampelo, asolaa ketambala no khwituunga mo keweno. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Apenee atulaa meje mwikhalai, andyaa khovasiinga megolo vahemba vakwe no khoepogusa kho ketambala kenaa aleitungagaa. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Panaa aleamopikela Simoni Petelo, nanoyo Simoni Petelo aleamowolya, “Mwene, ndakhowola mbi khokhogombela onsinge megolo jaane?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu amowelaa, “Okhagamanya ganaa nkhonojaa seji, ila oliija khogamanya ituungo lenaa liijile.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petelo amowelaa, “Nkha gechoo, khotopo wiije onsinge megolo jaane ninga nsiko yemwi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesu amowelaa, “Mbe ndeke khokosinga megolo jakhoo, khotopo wiije owe palomwi nane.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Apenee Simoni Petelo amowelaa, “Mwene, mbe gechoo okhansinge megolo topo, onsinge mekhono jaane ne itwe laane.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu amowelaa, “Muntu yunaa ogagaa, khopogiwa khosiinga megolo topo, kho nguno khoowa elopagaa mowele gwensi, gechoo onywenywe mwelopaga, ila nkha vensi.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu aleapalaa gechoo, kho nguno aleamomanyaa oyoo yunaa alamogalokha. Avyenee aleapalaa, “Nkha vensi vanaa mole welo.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khovasinga megolo vahemba vakwe, alealyalaa khanke mwenda gwakwe gwa pachanya, aleatuwaa khanke pa lwande ya kholyeela endya, nanoyo avawolya, “Mbi, mwamanyaga ganaa alenavawelaga? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Onywenywe mokhonyeeta onene Molaangi, khanke mokhonyeeta Mwene, gechoo mokhopaala visoga kho nguno avyenee venaa mpwale. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Onene nde Mwene no Molaangi wenyu, navasinga megolo yenyu. Gechoo nanyu mokhopogiwa mosingane megolo jenyu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Navapelaga mofwano, ili nanyu monoje kete venaa alealenavanojelaga. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Nkovaweela khwa khapanga, vatumami nkha valaala khokela vanaa vakhovatomekela, ninga vakhombe nkha valaala khokela vanaa vakhovatoma. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Mbe mojemanye mpola eje, Matuunda alavanojela masoga mbe molaganoja.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Nane nkha khovapalela onywenywe vensi, mbamanyile evoo vanaa alenavasagola. Ila lekhaa Maandekho ga Matuunda gadugame, kete venaa gakhopaala, ‘Muntu yunaa kholyaa endya palomwi nane, awaga mobe waa ne.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Nkhovaweela mpola eje taali panaa jikhale khopumeela, ili panaa jelapumela molaawa mokhongoomba kete ‘Onenee Amwenee.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, yeyensi yunaa khomopokela oyoo yunaa alenamotoma khompokela onene. Ne yeyensi yunaa khompokela onene, khomopekela oyoo yunaa aleantoma.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khokunelelya muntu yunaa alamogalokha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mateo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maluko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khopaala egoo, aleasayaa modugo momooyo gwakwe, apalaa, “Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, yomwi wenyu alangalokha.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Vahemba vakwe vensi alevandyaa khwikuuna, ila alevakhamanya kete alekhomopalela ananuu. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Yomwi wa vahemba vakwe oyoo yunaa aleatogilwee modugo no Yesu, aleikhala pepi no Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Petelo aleamosinelya no khopaala, “Mowolye khomopalaa ananuu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Apenee mohemba oyoo yunaa angile pepi no Yesu, amowolya, “Mwene, khomopalelaa ananuu?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu apalaa, “Muntu oyoo yunaa alenamopeela ibande la mokate kenaa alenakiina mwi bakhuli oyoo amwene.” Apenee aleasolaa ibande la mokate, iina, amopela Yuda, yunaa angile mwanaakwe Simoni. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Panaa Yuda alealya ibande la mokate, Khatawe aleamwingelaa. Apenee Yesu amowelaa, “Kenaa khopooga khonojaa, nogajaa waango waango.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ila khotopo muntu ninga yomwi mo vamoonga vawe vanaa alevapwale epoo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kho nguno Yuda amwenee angile khowamba mofukho mpia ja vahemba vensi, vamoonga vawe alevakhosiima kete Yesu angile khomowelaa Yuda apete agole vento venaa alevekhopogiwa kho wenga wa Pasakha. Ao khovapeela vapeena.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yuda panaa aleamalya kholya ibande la mokate aleapumaa panji, eloo angile ituungo la otikho.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njaanga mpyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda panaa aleapuma panji, Yesu aleapalaa, “Seji Mwana wa Muntu apelagwa olaala wakwe wa khapanga, no mokhate yakwe Matuunda apelagwa olaala. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Kho nguno alagelaga olaala wa Matuunda, Matuunda nanoyo alalagela olaala wa Mwana patopo khotin'yaa. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Vanaane amba mpwale nanyu khwi ituungo ikupe topo. Molampoga ila kete venaa alenavaweela valaala Vayahudi kete khonaa mpetile onene, onywenywee khotopo mopete.”<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Nkhovapeela njaanga mpyaa, Mwitogagwe, kete venaa onene alenkhovatogwa onywenywe, avivyoo nanyu mwitogagwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Mbe moliitogwa, vantu vensi valamanya kete onywenywe mole vahemba vaane.<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khokunelelya Petelo alamosita</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petelo aleamowolya Yesu, “Mwene, opetile kwenii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesu amowelaa, “Okhoo khonaa njile seji, onywenywe khotopo mondonde. Ila molandonda ituungo lenaa liijile.”<verse eid="JHN 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petelo aleamowolya, “Mwene, kho kee nkhakhowola khokholoonda seji? Afazali mfwee kho nguno yakhoo.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu amowolya, “Mbi, olagombaa khofwa kho nguno yaane? Ila nkhokhowela panaa njogolo amba ikhaale khowekha, olapala mala jetato.”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu amwenee njela ya khopeta khwa Matuunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu aleavawelaa, “Mokhatungumale mo meoyo jenyu, ila mogombagi Matuunda, no khongomba onene. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Khokhaye khwa Daada yaane khole ne wikhalo minki. Mbe anga nkha gechoo, anga khotopo mbawele, kete mpetile khovanogelelya wikhalo. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Ne panaa ndamalya khovaandalela wikhalo, ndavatuvela khovasola ili panaa mpwale onene, nanyu mowee epoo. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Onywenywe moemanyile njela ya khopikha khonaa onene mpetile.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi aleamowolya, “Mwene, khokhamanya khonaa opetile, gechoo akhomanya mbi njela?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu amowelaa, “Onene amwenee njela, khapanga no opanga. Muntu khotopo apikhe khwa Daada mbe akhalongolwa nane. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Mbe angamomanye onene, molamomanya no Daada yaane khanke. Khopuma seji momomanyile Daada yaane, ne mwamowonaga.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo amowelaa, “Mwene, kholagelee Daada, eloo topo lakhwelaga.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu amowelaa, “Nikhalaga palomwi nanyu khwi ituungo itale, Mbi okhale okhammanya? Muntu yeyensi yunaa ambonagaa onenee, amowonaga Daada. Gechoo kho kee mokhombweela, ‘Mbalagele Daada’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Mbi, okhakhogoomba kete onene nde mokhate mwa Daada, no Daada alemokhate yaane? Okhombe wonaa nkhopaala nkha waane, ila Daada yunaa khwikhala mokhate yaane amwenee yunaa khonojaa molemo gwaane. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Mongombage panaa nkhovaweela nde mokhate mwa Daada no Daada apwale mokhate yaane. Mbe mokhamokhogoomba, ila gombagi khwa lomekho jenaa alemwajewonaga. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Khwa khapanga, evoo vanaa vakhongombaa valanojaa melemo jenaa nkhonoja, ne khwa khapanga valanoja melemo mekolo khokela eje kho nguno onene mpetile khwa Daada. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Ndavanogelya chechensi kenaa molalomba khwa matogwi gaane nane ndavapela, ili Daada akholiwe khokelela Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Mbe molandomba chechensi kenaa kepwale mowitogwi waane ndanoja.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moye wa Matuunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Mbe montogwilwe molajelonda njaanga jaane. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Nane ndamolomba Daada nanoyo alavapela Mwalya yoonge, yunaa alaawa nanyu nsiko jensi. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Oyoo amwene Moye Matuunda yunaa alavalagela okhapanga. Vantu va paliwelelo khotopo vamopokelee kho nguno vakhavakhomowona no khomomanya. Ila onywenywe momomanyile kho nguno khwikhala palomwi nanyu, nanoyo alaawa mokhate yenyu.”<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Khotopo mbaleke kete vana vapeena, ila ndavatuvela. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Lasigaga ituungo ikupe vantu va paliwelelo khotopo vambone. Ila onywenywe molambona, kho nguno ntite opanga, nanyu molaawa no opanga. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Nsiko eyoo molamanya kete onene mpwale mokhate ya Daada yaane, nanyu mopwale mokhate yaane, nane nde mokhate yenyu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Muntu yeyensi yunaa khojigombaa njaanga jaane no khojeloonda, oyoo amwenee antogwile. Daada yaane khomotogwa muntu yeyensi yunaa khontogwa onene, nane avivyoo ndamotogwa no khwilagela khwakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Apenee Yuda, yunaa akha Isikaliote, awolyaa, “Mwene, kho kee khopooga wilagele khwisu, ila nkha kho vantu va paliwelelo?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu amowelaa, avawelaa, “Vantu vanaa vantogwile valagalondaa malaangi gaane no Daada yaane alavatogwa. Apenee onene no Daada yaane kholaija khwawo no khosamela khwenyu. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Ila yeyensi yunaa akhantogwa akhakholondaa malaangi gaane. Malaangi ganaa mwagategelaga nkha gaane, ila a ga Daada yunaa aleantomaa.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Navawelaga mpola eje panaa angile mpwale palomwi nanyu. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ila oyoo Mwalya, yunaa a Moye wa Matuunda, yunaa Daada alamotoma khwenyu, khonojaa kho nguno yaane, alavaliga mpola jensi no khovakhombolya gensi ganaa alenavaweela.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Nkhovalekela wikhalo mosoga, osoga owo wonaa nkhovapeela, nkha kete yenaa mokhopelwa ne vantu va paliwelelo, mokhasayage momeoyo jenyu, ninga khontungumala. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Alemwantegeela panaa alenavaweela, ‘Nkhowookha, ila ndavatuvela.’ Mbe montogwile anga amosekha kete mpetile khwa Daada, kho nguno Daada a molaala khokela onene. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Navawelaga ega panaa gakhale khopumeela, ili panaa galapumela mokhowole khogoomba. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Khotopo mpale nanyu khwi ituungo itale, kho nguno Khatawe, molaala wa liwelelo ele ijilee, ila atokhola olaala khwaane. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Ila vantu va paliwelelo vakhopogiwa vamanye kete mbotogwile Daada, kete venaa Daada yaane aleandiga avyenee venaa nkhonojaa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Imelelagi khowooke epa.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu amwenee mozabibu gwa khapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Yesu apalaa, onene amwenee mozabibu gwa khapanga, no Daada yaane amwenee molemi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kela itambe lenaa lakhalekholela viligi, kholedomolaa. Ila kela itambe lenaa lekholela viligi, khopogelela ili lelele viligi vinki modugo. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Onywenywe mwisaganja visoga palomwi nane, kho nguno ya maalangi gaane ganaa alenavaligaga. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Ikhalagi mokhate yaane, kete venaa onene nkhwikhala mokhate yenyu. Kete venaa khotopo itambe lenaa lekholela lenee patokhola khovambelela pa mozabibu, avivyoo khotopo monojee ganaa khopogaa Matuunda mbe khotopo mwikhale mokhate yaane.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Onene nde itina la mozabibu, nanyu mole matambe. Muntu yunaa khwikhala mokhate yaane, nane nikhale mokhate yakwe, oyoo alalela viligi vinki, onene itina panaa amba ntapoya onywenywe khotopo monoje chechensi. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Mbe muntu yeyensi akhakhwikhala mokhate yaane, khwipyana ne itambe lenaa lekhosombwa no khonyaala, matambe egoo gakhokunganywa no khosombwa kho momoto no khopya. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mbe mwikhale mokhate yaane, ne mpola jaane mbe jiikhale mokhate yenyu, lombagi chechensi kenaa mopogile nanyu molapelwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Daada yaane alakholiwa mbe amolela viligi vinki, eloo lelagela kete mole vahemba vaane.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />“Kete venaa Daada yaane aleantogwa onene, onene navatogagwa onywenywe. Sigagi kho otogwi waane. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Mbe molajewamba njaanga jaane, molasiga kho otogwi waane, kete venaa onene alenkhojelonda njaanga ja Daada yaane no khosiiga kho otogwi wakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Navawelaga mpola ejoo, ili mwijolwe ne nsekho kete venaa onene ntite nsekho, ne nsekho yenyu idugame. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Njaanga yaane ayenee eye, Mwitogagwe kete venaa onene alenkhovatogwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Khotopo otogwi mokolo khokela owo, wa muntu khopumya opanga wakwe kho nguno ya valaasi vakwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Nanyu mwawaga valaasi vaane, mbe molanoja ganaa nkhovaweela. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Nkha nkhoveeta khanke vasi, kho nguno mwasi akhamanya kenaa khonojaa mwene wakwe. Ila onene navaetaga onywenywe valaasi vaane, kho nguno navawelaga gensi ganaa nategalaga khopuma khwa Daada yaane. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Onywenywe alemokhansagola onene, ila onene amwenee alenavasagolaa mowee vahemba vaane, alenavasagola ili mopete kholela viligi venaa vekhawola, gechoo kela kento kenaa molamolomba Daada kete venaa khopogaa alavapela. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Seji nkhovaweela geeke mwitogagwe.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vantu va paliwelo vakhovasimbela vahemba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Mbe vantu va paliwelelo vawasimbele onywenywe, manyagi kete alevalongola khonsimbela onene, panaa alevakhale khovasimbela onywenywe. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Mbe anga mowee mole vantu va paliwelelo ele, vantu va paliweleo anga avavatogwa onywenywe kete venaa vakhovatogwa vantu vawe. Ila onywenywe nkha vantu va paliwelelo ele kho nguno navasagolaga onywenywe khopuma kho liwelelo ili mowee vantu vaane. Gechoo vantu va paliwelelo vakhovasimbela. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Khombolagi ganaa alenavaweela, ‘Mwasi akha mokolo khokela mwene wakwe’ kete venaa alevangayanja onene, valavagayanja ninga nanyu. Mbe valavamba mpola jaane, valavamba ne mpola jenyu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Ila valavanojela ega gensi khonguno mokhondoonda onene, vakhonoja gechoo khonguno vakhamomanya yunaa aleantomaa. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Mbe anga ndeke khwija no khopaala nanevo anga amba vatokhola mabe. Ila seji khotopo vasiite kete vatokhola mabe. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Muntu yunaa khonsimbela onene, akhomosimbela Daada yaane. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Mbe onene anga mbe nkhanoja matuntumu yenaa khotopo muntu yeyensi yunaa aleanoja movamoonga vawe, anga amba vatokhola mabe. Ila seji vawonaga matuntumu ganaa naganogaja, ne vakwendelela khonsimbela onene no Daada yaane. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ega gapumelaga ili Maandekho ga Matuunda ganaa gakhopaala, ‘Vansimbelaga patokhola nguno gadugame.’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Panaa aliija oyoo Mwalya yunaa ndamotoma khwenyu khopuma khwa Daada, oyoo Moye yunaa khovapalelaa okhapanga wa Matuunda. Omwenee alavawela ganaa agamanyile gakhombugela onene. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Ninga nanyu molavawela vantu mpola jenaa mojemanyile khombugela onene, kho nguno angile mole palomwi nane khopuma mwandyo.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Yesu aleendelela khopaala, navawelaga mpola eje jensi, ili mokhaleke khongoomba. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Valaala va nyoomba yakhwitangela Vayahudi, khotopo vawagombele khonojaa melemo jenyu omo, ituungo liijile panaa evoo vanaa vakhovawolaga valasiima khwa khonojaa gechoo vakhomotomamela Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Vantu evoo valanoja gechoo kho nguno vakhamomanya Daada ninga onene. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Navawelaga mpola eji seji, ili ituungo eloo panaa lelapikha mwiije mokhombolage kete navawelile.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Molemo gwa Moye wa Matuunda</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Alenkhavawelaa mpola eji mpuma mwandyo, kho nguno angile nkhale nde palomwi nanyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Ila seji ntuwile khwa oyoo yunaa aleantoma khwenyu, no khotopo muntu ninga yomwi yunaa khombolya, ‘Opetile khwenii?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Mokhosaaya vikhamu momeoyo jenyu kho nguno navawelaga mpola eji. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Khapanga a kete geeke, khowookha khwaane khokhovalya onywenywe, kho nguno mbe nkhawookha, Mwalya khotopo iije khwenyu. Ila mbe ndawookha, ndamotoma khwenyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Mwalya panaa aliija alavalagela vantu vensi va paliweleo chanya ya mabe gawe, ne alavalagela chanya ya khogombelwa khwawe paulongolo wa Matuunda, ne chanya khotengemekhwa khwawe. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Mwalya oyoo alavalagela kete vatite mabe, kho nguno alevakhangomba onene. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Alavalagela kete onene nkhogombekha ne Matuunda, mpetile khwa Daada, gechoo khotopo mombone khanke. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Kho mpola ja khotengemekha, kho nguno Khatawe, yunaa a molaala wa liwelelo ele, atengemekhagwa no Matuunda.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Nkhale ntite minki gakhovaweela, ila kho seji khotopo khonguno mogamanye. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Moye wa Matuunda panaa aliija, Moye yunaa khovapalelaa okhapanga wa Matuunda, omwenee alavalongolya no khovaliga khapanga yensi. Khotopo avalige ganaa gakwe mwenee, ila alavaliga egoo gensi ganaa khogategela khopuma khwaane, nanoyo alavawela mpola jenaa jelapumela nsiko jenaa jiijile. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Moye wa Matuunda oyoo yunaa khovapalela okhapanga, alankholya onene khonguno alavawela mpola jensi jenaa alaawa ategelaga khopuma khwaane. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Vento vyensi venaa atite Daada a vyaane. Avyenee napalaga kete oyoo Moye wa Matuunda alaosola okhombe waane no khovaweela onywenywe.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khogalokha khwa khosaaya khowa nsekho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Yesu aleavawela vahemba vakwe, lekhale ituungo ikupe topo moleke khombona, ne ituungo ikupe lenaa lejile khanke molambona.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Apenee vamoonga va vahemba vakwe vandya khwiwolya, “Okhopalelaa kee panaa okhopala? Lekhale ituungo ikupe topo moleke khombona, ne panaa okhopala ituungo ikupe lenaa lijile molambona khanke, ‘Avivyoo panaa okhopala kho nguno mpetile khwa Daada.’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Vendelela khwiwolya, Khopalelaa kee panaa khopalaa, ‘Lekhale ituungo ikupe’? Khokhamanya ganaa khopalela.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu aleamanyaa kete vahemba vakwe alevakhopooga khomowolya, gechoo avawelaa, “Mbi mokhwiwolya moleemwi kete angile nkhopalela kee, lekhale ituungo ikupe khotopo mombone, ne ituungo ikupe lenaa lejile molambona?” <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, molakota no khosaaya, ila vantu va paliwelelo valasekelela, onywenywe molasaya ila masaayo genyu galagalokha gawe nsekho. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Mokhiima panaa khwitungulaa mwana, khwitegela osati mokhakha, kho nguno ituungo lakwe la magayo lapikhaga, ila mbe mwana alelagwa, akhakhokombolaa khanke osati owoo, kho nguno khowaa ne nsekho ya khomoleeta muntu paliwelelo. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Nanyu avivyoo seji mopwale ne osaati, ila ndavatuwela khanke ne meoyo jenyu jelaawa ne nsekho, ne khotopo muntu yunaa alavasukha nsekho yenyu.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Nsiko eyoo khotopo mondombe chechensi. Nkhovaweela khwa khapanga, Daada yaane alavapela chechensi kenaa molamolomba kho olaala waane. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mpakha seji mokhalomba chechensi kho olaala waane, molombagi Matuunda, nanoyo alavapela, gechoo nsekho yenyu iladugama.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aleasumaga liwelelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Navawelaga mpola ejoo khwa mefwano. Ila ituungo lijile lenaa ndapala nanyu khwa mefwano, gechoo ndavawela mpola ja Daada pawelo. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Nsiko eyoo molamolomba Daada khwa olaala waane, nkhankhovawelaa kete ndavalombela khwa Daada. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Kho nguno Daada mwenee avatogwile, kho nguno onywenywe montogwile onene, nanyu mwagombaga kete onene napumaga khwa Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nalenapuma khwa Daada, niija paliwelelo ne seji nkhowookha paliweleo mpetile khwa Daada.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Apenee vahemba vakwe vamoweela, “Amba visoga! Seji khopaala naswi patokhola khosweekha ninga nkha khwa mefwano. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Seji khomanyile kete ogwegwe ogamanyile gensi, gechoo muntu yeyensi khotopo akhowolye khonguno ogamanyile ninga ganaa vantu vakhosiima. Khwa mpola eye khokogoomba kete ogwegwe wapumaga khwa Matuunda.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu avawolya, “Mbi, seji mokhogoomba? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Gechoo ntegelelaji, ituungo lijile ne taali lapikhapa, onywenywe molasambala, ne kela muntu alapeta khokhayakwe, nane molandekha ndeemwi, ila onene nkha ndeemwi kho nguno Daada apwale palomwi nane. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Navawelaga mpola eji ili mowee no wikhalo mosoga mokhate yenyu, kho liwelelo ele molagaya, ila ipelagi mooyo kho nguno onene nalisumaga liwelelo.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khovalombelaa vahemba vakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khopaala egoo, aleakunaa khochanya khwa Matuunda, apalaa, “Daada, ituungo lapikhaga. Valagelee vantu olaala wa Mwanaakho, ili no Mwanaakho avalageele olaala wakhoo. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kho nguno wamopelaga Mwanaakho olaala khwa vantu vensi, ili avapele opanga wa nsiko jensi, vensi evoo vanaa wamopelaga ogwegwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />No opanga wa nsiko jensi awenee owo, vantu vakhomanye kete ogwegwe amwenee Matuunda oleemwi wa khapanga, ne vammanye onene Yesu Kilisto yunaa alewantoma paliwelelo. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Onene nakhokholajaa khwa khomala khotomama molemo gonaa alewampelaga nojee. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Seji Daada nkholomba ompele olaala owo wonaa angile ntite palomwi nagwe, panaa liwelelo angile letapoya.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Navalagelaga evoo vantu vanaa alewampela khopuma paliweleo venaa ogwegwe opwale. Angile vantu vakhoo, nagwe wampela onene, nanevo vanogaja ganaa alewavaweela vanoje. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Seji vamanyile kete chechensi kenaa alewampela chapumaga khwakhoo, <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />kho nguno egoo ganaa alewambwelaga navaligaga, nanevo vagapokelaga ne vamanyile kete khapanga onene napumaga khwakhoo, ne vagombaga kete ogwegwe alewantoma.”<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Onene nkhovalombela evenee, nkhakhovalombela evoo vanaa vakhangoomba, ila nkhovalombela evoo vanaa alewampela, kho nguno evoo a vantu vakhoo. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Vantu vensi vanaa a vaane, a vakhoo, ne vensi vanaa otite a vaane, nane napelagwa olaala wawe venaa vakhwikhala. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Seji nijile khwakhoo, onene ntapoya khanke paliwelelo, ila evene vakhale vapwale paliwelelo. Matuunda yunaa oleemwi modugami, ewa vanaa wampelaga ovasonge kho olaala wakhoo, ili vawee kento kemwii kete venaa osweswe khole kento kemwii. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Panaa alempwale palomwi nanevo, onene alenavasonga khwa khovalagela okhapanga wonaa alewampela venaa ogwegwe opwale. Alenavasonga vakhawambwe ne obe, gechoo alenkhamopwelya ninga yomwi, ila topo yunaa aleandekelwa khononwa, ili gadugame egoo ganaa alegandekhwa kho Maandekho ga Matuunda kete galamopikha. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Seji nijile khwakhoo, ila nkhopaala mpola eje panaa mpwale paliwelelo, ili vawee ne nsekho ya khapanga kete venaa ntite nsekho yenaa ya khapanga. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Onene navaligaga egoo ganaa aleokhopooga mbalige ne vantu va paliweleo vakhovasimbela, kho nguno evenee nkha vantu va paliwelelo ele, kete venaa onene nkha wa paliwelelo ele. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nkhankhokholomba ovawoche paliwelelo, ila nkhokholomba ovasonge no oyoo Mobe Khatawe. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Evenee nkha vantu va paliwelelo ele, kete venaa onene nkha wa paliwelelo ele. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Kho nguno malaangi gakhoo a ga khapanga, ovanoje nanevo vawee va khapanga. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Kete venaa alewantoma khwa vantu va paliwelelo, avyenee nane nkhovatoma khwa vantu va paliwelelo. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Nkhwituula khokhotomamela ogwegwe kho nguno yawe, ili nanevo vituule khwakhoo khwa njela ya khapanga.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Nkhankhovalombela ewa topo, ila nkhovalombela ne evoo vanaa valagomba khokelela okhombe vanaa ewa vanaa vangombaga valawatengela. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Nkhovalombela vawee kento kemwi, kete venaa ogwegwe Daada, opwale mokhate yaane, nane mokhate yakhoo, nanevo vawee mokhate yisu, ili vantu va paliwelelo vagoombe kete ogwegwe amwenee alewantoma. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Loojo yenaa alewampeela onene, nane vavapelaga evenee, ili nanevo vawee kento kemwi kete venaa osweswe khole kento kemwi <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Onene mbe nde mokhate mwawe, nagwe owee mokhate yaane, ili meoyo jawe jepetane khapanga, apenee vantu va paliwelelo valamanya kete mpumile khwakhoo, ne ovatogwile kete venaa ontogwile onene.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Daada, nkhotamanela evoo vanaa alewampela vawee palomwi nane lwande yenaa ndaawa mpwale, ili vawone olaala no mung'alalo waane wonaa alewampela, kho nguno alewantogwa panaa liwelelo angile letapoya. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Daada yunaa khonojaa ganaa gakhapanga, vantu va paliwelelo alevakhakhomanya, ila onene nkhomanyile, ewa nanevo vamanyile kete ogwegwe amwenee alewantoma. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Navalagelaga venaa opwale, ne anendelela khonojaa gechoo, ili otogwi wakhoo wonaa otite khwaane, owee mokhate yawe, nane mbe nde mokhate yawe.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khogwelwaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu panaa aleamalya kholoomba, omwenee palomwi ne vahemba alevalowokha ikhwawa la Kidiloni, vapeta kho lwande yenaa angile khole no mogonda gwa mapeke ga mizeituni, nanevo aleviingela omoo. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda yunaa alamogalokha Yesu, aleapamanyile pa lwande eyoo, kho nguno Yesu ne vahemba vakhwe alevamanyiine khwitanga okhoo. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Gechoo Yuda aleapeta kho mogonda ogoo, vilongolaja ne masinjala, palomwi ne valendeleli va Nyoomba ya Matuunda vanaa alevatomwile ne valaala va vapumya matambekho ne Mafalisayo. Nanevo angile vakepwile tala ne nyeenge ne chaanjo. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Apenee Yesu okho amanyile gensi ganaa galamopumela, ipumelya paulongolo wawe, avawolya, “Mokhomopooga ananuu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Nanevo alevamoweela, “Khokhomopooga Yesu wa kho Nazaleti!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yesu avawelaa, “Onene amwenee.” Yuda yunaa alamogelokha, nanoyo angile imelile palomwi nanevo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Yesu panaa aleavawelaa, “Onene amwenee,” alevatuuva kho nyuma no khogwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu aleavawolya khanke, “Mokhomopooga ananuu?” Vamoweela, “Yesu wa khokhomopooga Yesu wa kho Nazaleti!” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu avawelaa, “Navawelile onene amwenee. Mbe monkhompooga onene, valekhagi vanaa vapwale nane vapetage.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Aleapala gechoo ili ganaa angile apalagaa gadugame, “Daada vantu evoo vanaa alewampelaga, nkhamopwelya ninga muntu yomwi.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Apenee Simoni Petelo yunaa angile atite mpanga, aleausolomola, amoputula itwi la molyelo motomami wa mopumya matambekho molaala. Mwasi oyoo alekhwetwa Malukusi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu amolagelelya Petelo, “Tuvyaa mpanga mo ala yakhwe. Mbi, okhamanya kete nkhopogiwa mpokeele magayo, ganaa Daada yaane khopogaa nkelele?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khokenkhwa Anasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Apenee masinjala evoo, ne valaala vawe ne valendeli va Nyoomba ya Matuunda, alevamogweela Yesu no khomotuunga. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Molaala wa mwandyo khonaa alevamokenka Yesu angile a Anasi, yunaa angile mokhwingwa wa Kayafa. Kayafa amwenee angile mopumya matambekho molaala kho mwakha ogoo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kayafa amwene angile avayangola valaala va Vayahudi kete amba visoga mbe muntu yomwi khaafwa kho nguno ya vantu vensi.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo khomositaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mateo 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maluko 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22:55-57</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petelo palomwi no mohemba yoonge alevamoloonda Yesu. Kho nguno mohemba oyoo angile vimanyile no mopumya matambekho molaala, gechoo aleingelaa mo ibololo la mopumya matambekho molaala. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Ila Petelo aleimelelaga panji ya molyango gwa khwingelela mo ibololo. Apenee mohemba oyoo yunaa angile vimanyine no mopumya matambekho molaala aleapuma panji, apalaa no mwalele yomwi molindelelya molyango, ne amwingelya Petelo mokhate. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Mwalele oyoo yunaa angile molendelelya molyango, aleamowolya Petelo, “Mbi, ninga ogwegwe ole yomwi wa vahemba wa muntu oyo?” Petelo aleamowela, “Khotopo nkha nenee.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Ituungo eloo angile ituungo la mpepo, vasi ne valendeleli angile vakholajaa moto gwa makhala, nanevo angile vagopilimaga vakhota. Nanoyo Petelo aleimelela palomwi nanevo khota moto.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mopumya matambekho molaala khomowolya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mateo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maluko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Apenee Anasi angile awilee mopumya matambekho molaala aleamowolya Yesu mpola ja vahemba vakwe ne malaangi gakwe. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu amowelaa, “Kela ituungo alenkholiga pawelo, kho nyoomba ya khwitangela Vayahudi no kho nyoomba ya Matuunda, khonaa avitangaga Vayahudi vensi, khotopo kento kenaa angile naligaga khwa osweki. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Kho kee khombolya? Vawolye evoo vanaa alevategela kenaa alenkhovaweela. Evenee vamanyile ganaa alenavaweela.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Panaa aleamalya khopaala gechoo sinjala yomwi yunaa angile imagaa pepi nanoyo alemopatula nkhofi Yesu no khomoweela, “Mbi, gechoo avyenee nomowela mopumya matambekho molaala?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu amowelaa, “Mbe napalaga mpola yenaa nkha nsoga, palaa ganaa napalaga nkha masoga, ila mbe napala visoga, kho kee wanipatula?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Apenee Anasi aleamokenkha Yesu khwa mopumya matambekho molaala yunaa angile khwetwaa Kayafa okho atungagwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo khomosiita Yesu khanke</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mateo 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maluko 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22:58-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simoni Petelo panaa angile apwale epoo khotaa moto, vamowolya, “Mbi, ninga nagwe okha ole yomwi wa vahemba vakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">“Khotopo onene nkha yomwi wawe.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Mwasi yomwi wa mopumya matambekho molaala, modoakwe no oyoo yunaa aleaputulwa itwi no Petelo, aleamowolya, “Mbi, alenkhakhowona ogwegwe ole palomwi no Yesu okhoo kho mogonda gwa mapeke ga mezaituni?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petelo aleasitaa khanke, apaponye njogolo aleyawekhaa.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khokenkhwa khwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maluko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Angile makingilima ne melawo, alevamosola Yesu khopuma khokhaye khwa Kayafa, vamokenkha kho ikolo la mwami Pilato, yunaa angile Mwami wa Valoma. Vayahudi alevakhaingela kho ikolo la Valoma, ili nanevo vakhowole khogombwa kho njaanga ja khomokumbekha Matuunda, ne vakhowole kholya endya ya Pasakha. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Gechoo, Pilato aleapuma panji khovawolya, “Mokhomositachaa muntu oyo kho mabe kee?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Vamoweela, “Mbe muntu oyo anga awee nkha monoja mabe, anga khotopo khomolete khwakhoo.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato avawelaa, “Seji mosolagi mopete momotengemeke kho njaanga jenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Valaala va Vayahudi vamoweela, “Osweswe khokhalomwa khomowolaga muntu yeyensi.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Aleyapumela gechoo ili mpola jenaa aleapala Yesu kete alafwa ncha kee yadugame.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Apenee Pilato aleingela khanke mo ikolo la kewami, aleamweta Yesu no khomowolya, “Mbi ogwegwe amwene Mwami wa Vayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu amowolya, “Mbi, ogwegwe khopaala ega khwa masiimo gakhoo mwenee ao vantu vaange vakhowelaga mpola jaane?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato nanoyo amowelaa, “Mbi, onene nde Moyahudi? Vantu vakhoo mwenee ne vapumya matambekho valaala avenee vakholetaga khwaane. Mbi wanogaja ibe kee?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu nanoyo amowelaa, “Owami waane nkha wa paliwelelo ele. Mbe owami waane anga owee wa paliwelelo ele, valondi vaane anga valikowa ili nkhagwelwe ne Vayahudi. Ila owami waane nkha wa paliwelelo ele.” <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Epoo Pilato amowolya, “Kho gechoo ogwegwe ole Mwami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">“Yesu nanoyo amowelaa, ogwegwe khopaala kete onene nde Mwami. Onene alenalelwaa kho nguno ya ele, aleniija paliweleo ili khovaweela vantu okhapanga. Kela muntu yunaa khotogwa okhapanga khotembola kete ganaa nkhopaala a ga khapanga.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato amowolya, “Okhapanga a chanuu?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu khotengemekhwa khofwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mateo 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maluko 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilato panaa aleamalya khopaala gechoo, aleapuma khanke panji panaa alevapwale Vayahudi, avawelaa, “Onene nkhawona ibe lelensi lenaa anogaja muntu oyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ila onywenywe motile omanyani kela ituungo la wenga wa Pasakha, khomolekolela motungwa yomwi. Mbi mokhopooga mbopumye Mwami wa Vayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Apenee vantu vensi alevajoma madoolo no khopaala, “Okhamodigolele oyo! Khodigolele Balaba.” Nanoyo Balaba angile mosuki.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Apenee Pilato alealagelelya Yesu afwembwee menyepo ja ntila. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Nanevo masinjala vasola miyaa vanogelelya nkhofila kete ya kewami, vapeta khomolyekha Yesu khwi itwe. Khanke vamolyekha mwenda mokhasuku gwa kewami. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Vaawa vakhomopetela no khomolamocha khwa mabyeedo, “Kasinde Mwami wa Vayahudi!” Apenee vamopatolanga nkhofi.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato apuma panji khanke avaweela Vayahudi, “Kunagi, nkhomopumya khwenyu, kho nguno onene nkhawona ibe lelensi la khomotengemekha muntu oyo.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Apenee Yesu aleapuma panji okho alyalaga nkhofila eyoo ya miyaa ya kewami no mwenda mokhasuku gwa kewami. Pilato avawelaa, “Kunagi, muntu mwenee amwenee oyo.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Vapumya matambekho valaala ne valendeleli va Nyoomba ya Matuunda, panaa alevamowona alevajoma, vapaala. “Mokoweleli pamosalaba! Mokoweleli pamosalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Ila Pilato avawelaa, “Mosolagi nywenywee mopete momokoweleli pamosalaba, kho nguno onene nkhawona ibe lelensi lenaa anogaja.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Valaala va Vayahudi vamowelaa, “Osweswe khotite njaanga, no kho njaanga eye, khetopogaa muntu oyo achee, kho nguno angile khwinojaa amwenee Mwana wa Matuunda.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato panaa aleategela mpola ejo aleingelwa no wowa modugo. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Apenee ingela khanke kho nyoomba ya kewami, amowolya Yesu, kwenii khonaa apumagaa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Ila Yesu aleakhamowela chechensi. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Gechoo Pilato amowolya, “Okhosiita khopaala nane? Mbi, okhamanya kete onene ntite olaala wakhokholekolela ao khokhowolaga, ne wa kokokowelela pamosalaba?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Apenee Yesu amowelaa, “Anga mbe otokhola olaala owo, mbe Matuundaanga alekhe khokhopeela. Kho gechoo muntu yunaa aleandeta momekhono jakhoo amwenee atite mabe makolo khokela gensi.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Khwandelya epoo, Pilato aleapogaa njela ya khomolekolela Yesu, ila Vayahudi alevajoma no khopaala, “Mbe khomolekolela muntu oyo, ogwegwe amba nkha molaasi wa Kaisali, muntu yeyensi yunaa khwinojaa mwami khomositaa Kaisali!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilato panaa aleategela mpola ejoo, amopumya Yesu panji, ikhala pa kegoda cha khotengemekhela, kenaa angile kepwale pa lwande yenaa angile yanogelelajwa ne mabwe, kho Kiebulania vakwetaa, “Gabata”. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Ne ituungo eloo, angile kete saa sita ja lyonse, nsiko ya wiyandaleli kho nguno ya nsiko ya Pasakha. Pilato avawelaa Vayahudi, “Oyeepa Mwami wenyu!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Ila evenee vajomaa, “Mowolage! Mowolage! Mokoweleli pamosalaba!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato avawolya “Mbi, mbokoweleli Mwami wenyu pamosalaba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Vapumya matambekho valaala vamoweela, “Osweswe khotokhola Mwami yoonge ila Kaisali topo.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Apenee Pilato aleavapelaa Yesu ili vamokowelele pamosalaba.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu khokowelelwa pamosalaba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Apenee masinjala vamosola Yesu no khowookha nanoyo. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu apuma panji okho akepolaga mosalaba gwakwe khogokenkha panaa angile pakhwetwa “Ibankha la Motwe” Vaebulania angile vakhweta “Goligota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Panaa alevapikha epoo alevamokowelela Yesu palomwi ne vantu vaange vawele, yomwi lwande lwa molyelo no yoonge lwande lwa mokege, nanoyo Yesu angile alepakhate yawe.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato alealagelelya maandekho gandekhwe no khotuungwa pachanya ya mosalaba. Maandekho egoo alegandekhwaga geeke, “Yesu wa kho Nazaleti Mwami wa Vayahudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Ne maandekho egoo angile gandekwa kho Kiebulania, Kilatini, ne Kiyunani, Vayahudi vinki alevasoma maandekho egoo, kho nguno pa lwande yenaa Yesu aleakowelelwa angile pepi ne ihala. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Apenee, vapumya matambekho valaala ne Vayahudi, vamoweela Pilato, “Okhaandeke, ‘Mwami wa Vayahudi’, ila wandeke muntu oyo aleapalaa, ‘Omwene a Mwami wa Vayahudi.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato avawelaa, “Kenaa alenandekha, avivyoo nandekhaga!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Masinjala panaa alevamalya komokowelela Yesu pamosalaba, alevasola myenda jakwe, no khojegawan'ya maloondo ganee, kela sinjala alepata iloondo lemwi, avivyoo alevasola mwenda gwakwe gwa mokhate gonaa angile gosunilwe khwi ibande lemwi topo la ketambala khopuma pachanya mpakha panse. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Masinjala alevawelana, “Khokhaidemole, ila khowokowele ndiku ndikuka khowone ananuu yunaa khapata.” Ele alelapumeela ili Maandekho ga Matuunda gadugame, ganaa gakhopaala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Alevigawelaa myenda jaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">no mwenda gwaane gwa mokhate khopuma pachanya mpakha panse alevawokowela ndiku ndikukha.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Gechoo avyenee masinjala evoo alevanojaa.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Pepi no mosalaba wa Yesu, angile vimelelaga, nyinya no nyinya mokolo no Malia moliji wa Kileopa no Malia wa kho Magidala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu panaa aleamowona nyinya imelelaga pepi no mohemba oyoo yunaa angile amotogwile modugo, aleamowela nyinya, “Maye, seji oyoo amwenee a mwanaakho.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Khanke amowelaa mohemba oyoo, “Kunaa, seji oyoo amwenee nyokho.” No khwandelya epoo mohemba oyoo aleamosola nyinya wa Yesu no khwikhala nanoyo khokhayakwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khofwaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Yesu panaa aleawona molemo gwakwe gwasilaga, ili khoganoja Maandekho ga Matuunda gadugame apalaa, “Ntite nnyoota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ne epoo angile papwale ne ibakhuli lenaa angile lijwile divai yenaa angile yasasukhaga, apenee vadobya siponji mwi bakhuli la divai eyoo, vapagekha kho nkhome yenaa yekwetwa isopo, vanyanyola pachanya vamoketela momolomo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu panaa aleagemaa divai eyoo, apalaa, “Molemo gwaane gwasilaga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Panaa alekhotankha mooyo, aleasunamya motwe afwaa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kholaswaa mokhosa palowalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Angile nsiko ya wiyandaleli wa nsiko ya Khosuupa, khanke kho nsiko eyoo angile nsiko ya wenga wa Pasakha, Vayahudi alevakhapoga mevimba isiige pachanya pa mesalaba kho Nsiko ya Khosuupa. Gechoo alevapeta khwa Pilato, vamoloomba ili alagelelye megolo ja vantu evoo iwunwe ili vafwe nyango, vanaa angile vakowelelwaga pamosalaba, apenee mevimba jawe jetelemolwe khopuma pamosalaba. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Apenee masinjala alevapeta vamowuna megolo ja muntu wa mwandyo, no wa owele, vanaa angile vakowelelagwa pampelo ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ila panaa alevapikha khwa Yesu, alevamopikha afwagaa, gechoo alevakhamowuna megolo. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Ila sinjala yomwi aleamodola Yesu palowalu no mokhosa, apaponye chaji ne meje alevyandya khopuma <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Omwene yunaa aleawona mpola eye, apalaga ganaa agawonaga ili mopate khogoomba. Mpola yenaa aleawona ya khapanga ne amanyile kete lenaa khovaweela a khapanga. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Mpola eyoo aleyapumela ili Maandekho ga Matuunda gadugame, ganaa gakhopaala, “Khotopo ninga ikupa lakwe lenaa lelawunwa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Ne Maandekho ga Matuunda gaange gakhopaala, “Valamokuna muntu yunaa angile vamolasa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khozyekhwaa</para>
  <para style="s">Mateo 27:57-61; Maluko 15:42-47; Luka 23:50-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Panaa egoo gensi alegakela, Yusufu muntu yunaa khopumela Alimataya, yunaa angile mohemba wa Yesu khwa khwiswekha swekha kho nguno ya khovatungumala Vayahudi, aleamolomba Pilato amogombele khogosola mowele gwa Yesu. Pilato amogombela khogowocha mowele ogoo. Gechoo Yusufu aleagowocha <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Yusufu angile vilongolaja no Nikodemo. Nikodemo amwenee oyoo yunaa angile amopetela Yesu otikho, aleiija okho akepolagaa makhuta ganaa gasalinkhine ne makhuta ga mpia nyinki ganaa gakhwetwaa manemane no obani wa kilo makomi gatato. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Apenee vensi vawele alevagosola mowele gwa Yesu, alevamopakha makhuta ganaa gakhotukelela visoga, vaolyekha shanda njelo kete venaa aleipwale njaanga yawe ya Vayahudi ya khozyekha. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Lwande yenaa Yesu alevamokowelela pamosalaba, angile pepi no mogoonda gwa mapeke ga mizabibu, no kho mogoonda ogoo alepatite ikhabuli epyaa lenaa angile lekhale lezyekhe movimba yeyensi. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Gechoo, kho nguno angile nsiko ya wiyandeleli wa Nsiko ya Khosuupa, ne ikhabuli eloo angile lelepepi, vagotuula mowele gwa Yesu omoo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Yesu afufokhagaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1">Mateo 28:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maluko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Makingilima nsiko ya mwandyo wa juma, panaa lyonse alelekhale ledole, Malia wa khupuma Magidala aleapikha kho khabuli, awonaa ibwee lawokhajwa pa molyango. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Apenee, aleakembela lowelo mpakha khwa Simoni Petelo no khwa mohemba oyoo yunaa angile atogwilwe no Yesu, avawelaa, “Vawokhaja mowele gwa Mwene mokhabuli, ninga khokhamanya khonaa vamotulaga.”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Gechoo Petelo no mohemba oyoo yoonge alevapuma vapeta kho khabuli eloo. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Vensi vawele angile vakhokembela ila mohemba oyoo yoonge aleatite lowelo khokela Petelo, omwene amwenee awaa wa mwandyo khopikha khokhabuli. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Aleasunama khosonokeela mokhate, aleawonaa shanda topo mokhate ya ikhabuli, ila angile akhaingela mokhate. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Apenee Simoni Petelo aleapikha kho khabuli no khwingela mokhate, nanoyo aleajipikha shanda topo, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />ne echoo ketambala kenaa aleapilingagwa Yesu khwi itwe. Angile kekhatulwa palomwi ne shanda, ila angile chapilingagwa no khotulwa keleemwi. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Apenee no mohemba oyoo yoonge yunaa alealongola khopikha avivyo nanoyo aleingela mokhabuli, iwonela no khogoomba. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Kho nguno vahemba angile vakhale vatembole ga Maandekho ga Matuunda kete venaa gakhopaala, Yesu angile khopogiwa khofufokha. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Apenee vahemba evoo alevatuuwa khomakhayawe.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopumelaa Malia wa kho Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mateo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maluko 16:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Ila Malia akasiiga imelelaga panji yikhabuli okho khokotaa. Panaa angile akhale khokotaa, aleasunamaa no khosonekela mokhabuli, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />avawonaa vatomami va pachanya va Matuunda vawele vanaa valyalile myenda myelo, vikhalaga lwande yenaa mowele gwa Yesu angile wagonaga, yomwi angile ikhile khonaa itwe angile lepwale no yoonge angile ikhile khonaa megolo alejepwale. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Vatomami va pachanya pa Matuunda alevamowolya Malia, “Maye, kho kee khokoota?” Malia avawelaa, “Vawokhaja mowele gwa Mwene yaane, ninga nkhamanya khonaa vagotulaga.” <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Panaa aleapala gechoo, aleagalokha khonyoma no khomowona Yesu imelelaga epoo. Ila aleakhamotembola kete oyoo angile amwenee Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu amowolya, “Maye, kho kee khokoota? Khomopooga ananuu?” Malia, aleasiima kete oyoo angile mwangaleli wa mogoonda gwa mapeke, gechoo amowelaa, “Meyaa, mbe wagokenkhaga mowele gwakwe lwande yeyensi, mbwelee khonaa wagotulaga, nane ampete khogosola.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu eetaa, apalaa, “Malia!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Malia agalokha, amowelaa kho Kiebulania, “Laboni!” Emaana yakwe, “Molaangi”.<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu amowelaa, “Okhambambe, nkhale khopeta khochanya khwa Daada.” Ila petaa kho vadogwaane ovawele, “Onene nkhopapamokha khopeta khochanya khwa Daada yaane, yunaa ninga nanyu a Daada yenyu, Matuunda waane yunaa Matuunda wenyu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Apenee Malia wa kho Magidala aleapetaa vahemba ne avaweela, “Namowonaga Mwene.” Khanke aleavasonsomolela egoo ganaa Yesu aleamoweela.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khovapumelaa vahemba vakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Panaa aleyapikha mesee ya nsiko eyoo ya mwandyo ya ijuma, vahemba angile vapwale mokhate ya nyoomba, nanevo angile vadendaga melyango kho nguno ya khovatungumala valaala va Vayahudi. Yesu aleavapumelaa no khovaweela, “Wikhalo mosoga owee palomwi nanyu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Yesu panaa aleamalya khopaala gechoo, aleavalageela mekhono jakwe no lowalu lwakwe. Vahemba vakwe panaa alevamowona Mwene, alevasekelela modugo. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu avawelaa khanke, “Wikhalo mosoga owee palomwi nanyu. Kete venaa Daada aleantoma onene, nane nkhovatoma onywenywe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Nanoyo panaa aleamalya khopaala gechoo, aleavaputelelya mwayo, avawelaa, “Pokelagi Moye wa Matuunda. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Mbe molamosamehi muntu yeyensi mabe gegensi, Matuunda nanoyo alamosamehi muntu oyoo mabe gakwe gensi. Mbe molalekha khomosamehi muntu yeyensi mabe, muntu khotopo asamehewi.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khomopumela Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomasi yunaa alekhwetwa ipasa angile yomwi wa vahemba ikomi ne vawele va Yesu, ila angile atapoya palomwi ne vahemba vayakwe panaa Yesu aleavapumela. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Gechoo vahemba evoo vayakwe vamoweela, “Khwamowonaga Mwene.” Ila Tomasi avawelaa, “Mbe ndeke khowona mo mekhono jakwe mavamba ga mesumali no khoketela lojala lwaane kho momavamba egoo no khotuula mokhono gwane molowalu lwakwe, khapanga, khotopo ngoombe.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Panaa nsiko monane alejakela, vahemba vakwe angile viitaanga khanke palomwi kho nyoomba, nanoyo Tomasi angile apwale palomwi nanevo. Ninga venaa melyango angile idendilwe, Yesu aleapumela no khwimelela pakhate yawe, avawelaa, “Wikhalo mosoga owee palomwi nanyu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Apenee amowelaa Tomasi, “Ijo otoole lojala lwakhoo epa mekhono jaane, apenee ovambe ne mekhono jakhoo pa lowalu lwaane. Lekha wowa, ila gombagaa.” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi amowelaa, “Mwene waane no Matuunda waane.”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu amowolya, “Mbi, khogoomba kho nguno wambonaga? Vanogelajwa masoga evoo vanaa vakhambona, ila vangombaga.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguno ya ketabu eke khwandekhwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu aleanojaa lomekho jiinge nyinki jenaa vahemba vakwe alevajewona, jenaa angile jekhandekhwa kho ketabu eke. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ila lomekho jenaa jepwale mo ketabu eke, jandekhagwa ili mokhowole khogoomba kete Yesu amwenee Kilisto, Mwana wa Matuunda, no khwa khomogoomba mowee no opanga wa nsiko jensi.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu khovapumela vahemba saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Panaa alegakela egoo, Yesu angile avapumela khanke vahemba vakwe kho mpelo ya ilambo la Tibelia. Angile avapumela geeke, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Angile vamoonga va vahemba vikonganajaa palomwi, vahemba evoo angile, Simoni Petelo, Tomasi yunaa alekhwetwaa ipasa, no Natanaeli khopuma ihala la Kana la Galilaya, vana vawele va Zebedayo ne vahemba vaange vawele. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petelo aleavawelaa, “Mpetile kholuwa nshe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Vahemba vaange nanevo alevamoweela, “Osweswe vensi kholapeta palomwi nagwe.” Gechoo vensi vapuma no khwingela mwipogo. Ila otikho wensi angile vakhapata kento chechensi. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Igolo lakwe makingilima, Yesu aleijaa no khwimelela mompelo ya ilambo, ninga gechoo vahemba vakwe alevakhamotembola kete amwenee angile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Apenee Yesu avawolya, “Valaasi vaane, mbi, mokhapata kento chechensi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Evenee vamoweela, “Avyenee khokhapata kento chechensi.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Apenee avawelaa, “Telemoli megonyo lwande lwa molyelo wa ipogo lenyu, nanyu molapata nshe.” Gechoo, alevatelemola megenyo kho lwande eyoo, vapata nshe nyinki ninga vakonya khovanyenyola no khovingelya mwipogo.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Mohemba yunaa aleatogwilwe no Yesu aleamowela Petelo, “A Mwene.” Apaponye Simoni Petelo panaa aleategela kete a Mwene, aleitungaa mwenda gwakwe kho nguno angile apwale bwiinda, adikelaa mo meje. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Ila vahemba vaange alevakowa mintikho khoekenkha ipogo kho nse nkhaku, okho vakhokweesa megonyo jenaa angile jiijwile nshe mpakha kho nse nkhaku. Kho nguno angile vapwale khotale kete mita igana lemwi topo mpakha kho nse nkhaku. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Panaa alevapikha pampelo ya nse nkhaku ya ilambo, alevawona makhala ga moto gakholaga. No momoto ogoo alejipwale nshe ne mikate. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Apenee Yesu avawelaa, “Leti nshe jemoonga jenaa mwaluwaga ituungo ele.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Apenee Simoni Petelo aleatanta mwipogo no khwandya khokweesa mogonyo gonaa alegwijwile nshe mpakha pampelo ya ilambo, mogonyo ogoo alegotite nshe nkolo jenaa angile jepikile igana lemwi ne makomi gataano ne gatato. Ninga venaa nshe angile nyinki, mogonyo ogoo alegokhawunekha. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu avawelaa, “Mwiije kholyee endya.” Khotopo ninga mohemba yomwi yunaa aleamowolya, “Ogwegwe a nanuu?” Kho nguno angile vamanyaga kete a Mwene. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu aleiijaa, asolaa mikate eyoo no khovapeela, avivyoo aleasola ne nshe ejoo avapelaa.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Eye angile mala ya otato Yesu khovapumela vahemba vakwe mpuma panaa aleafufokha.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu khopalaa no Petelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Panaa alevamalya kholya, Yesu aleamowolya Simoni Petelo, “Simoni mwana wa Yohana, mbi, ontogwile onene khokela ewa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Nanoyo amowelaa, “Avyenee Mwene, omanyile kete nkhotogwile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu amowelaa, “Lisaji nkholo jaane.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Apenee Yesu amowolya khanke, “Simoni, mwana wa Yohana ontogwile onene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Nanoyo amowelaa, “Avyenee Mwene, ogwegwe omanyile kete nkhotogwile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Apenee Yesu amowelaa, “Songagaa nkholo jaane.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yesu amowolya khanke mala ya otato, “Simoni, mwana wa Yohana, ontogwile onene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Petelo aleasayaa kho nguno Yesu angile amowolya mala jetato, “Ontogwile?” Amowelaa, “Mwene, omanyile vyensi, omanyile kete onene nkhotogwile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu amowelaa, “Lisaji nkholo jaane. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Nkhokoweela khwa khapanga, panaa angile ole molomyana, angile okhwituunga mokhanki gwakhoo pakeweno no khopeta khonaa opogile. Ila panaa olakhombimpa olagolola mekhono jakhoo, muntu yoonge alakutunga mokhanki gwakhoo, alakhokenka khonaa olaawa okhatogwa khopeta.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu aleapalaa geeke khomolageela Petelo venaa alaafwa, ne venaa alamopela loojo Matuunda. Panaa aleamalya khopaala gechoo, amowelaa, “Ndondee.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu no mohemba yoonge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petelo aleagalokha no khomowona mohemba yoonge yunaa Yesu aleamotogilwe khovalondaa. Mohemba oyoo amwenee aleikhala pepi no Yesu panaa angile vakholya endya, no khomowolya Yesu, “Ananuu yunaa alakhogalokha?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Petelo panaa aleamowona, amowolya Yesu, “Mwene, no khwa oyo mpola kee yenaa elamopumela?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu amowelaa, “Mbe nkhopooga asiige mopanga mpakha panaa ndatuuwa, eloo lekhalekhokwalya, ogwegwe ndondagee onene.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Gechoo mpola eyoo aleyasambala movamoonga mwa vadogo evoo, kete mohemba oyoo khotopo afwee. Ila Yesu aleakhamowela mohemba oyoo kete khotopo achee. Ila omwene aleapalaa topo, “Mbe nkhopooga asiige mopanga mpakha panaa ndatuuwa, eloo lekhalekhokwalya.”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Mohemba oyoo amwenee yunaa aleagawona mapola ega ganaa khotowelaa, nanoyo amwenee yunaa aleavandekela mpola eji. Nasu khomanyile kete gensi ganaa khotowelaa a ga khapanga.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khomalelyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Khole mpola nyinki jenaa Yesu angile anogajaa. Mbe gensi anga gandekwe, nkhosiima kete anga amba khotopo chumba cha khokweela khovetuula evyoo.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>